e tzatziki ingredients together and put in a small serving bowl.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nSeason the lamb with salt, black pepper and a pinch of paprika. Griddle, grill or barbecue for 3 mins on each side or until the fat is nicely browned, then put in a serving dish and squeeze over the lemon halves. Scatter the aubergines with parsley, then serve with the lamb and tzatziki.	5	\N	Turkish	["ужин"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/imam-bayildi-bbq-lamb-tzatziki	mealdb:53253	[{"id": "88ffaac9-a123-4c31-a460-da2e46f73c52", "name": "Баклажан", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "2abb6236-93df-48a2-8005-fbea3b142357", "originalString": "150 г"}, {"id": "d4168823-9249-4a93-9596-61827982165a", "name": "Оливковое масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 30, "amount": 30, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "30 г"}, {"id": "fabe20fc-801e-4558-a8f6-7ee7f6f5383d", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "1fade550-ee9c-400e-93ac-749b25e7bd11", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "e0f652d7-c176-4ec5-a5cd-0d267d8e1ffd", "name": "Корица", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "c508be3b-b158-45c7-9a46-2326abea13d0", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "892cfbfc-e180-4c35-b3c6-f15e0a16d2d1", "name": "Помидор", "unit": "г", "grams": 400, "amount": 400, "ingredientId": "56af0c35-84c3-4e11-8c83-f306df2b10eb", "originalString": "400 г"}, {"id": "d6db4d54-9484-4dc4-9f1e-c759f20e3349", "name": "Петрушка", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "6f6bca24-b7e6-4c6a-9f84-86fb3e2c9dcd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "a8a5bf8d-e637-4da8-a845-074f6a614682", "name": "Баранина", "unit": "г", "grams": 600, "amount": 600, "ingredientId": "592dc5ae-f7ea-4cb8-b6db-bb6600636bd4", "originalString": "600 г"}