 fold the pastry over to make a half-moon shape. Fold in the edges, twisting them to seal, and place on a non-stick baking sheet. Repeat with the remaining pastry and filling to make 8 briks in all.\r\nLightly brush the briks with the remaining oil. Bake for 12тАУ15 minutes or until the pastry is crisp and golden brown.\r\nMeanwhile, combine the tomatoes and cucumber in a bowl and sprinkle with the lemon juice and seasoning to taste. Serve the briks hot with this salad and the chutney.	5	\N	Tunisian	["ужин"]	t	http://allrecipes.co.uk/recipe/3096/tunisian-tuna-and-egg-briks.aspx	mealdb:52975	[{"id": "a5ef1ef2-e757-4167-8c9c-46883d0d4e26", "name": "Оливковое масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "49174bf2-fad1-4b4a-bb1e-cf3d38bccb49", "name": "Зелёный лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 400, "amount": 400, "ingredientId": "e15bcbde-b1b4-4df4-a673-98865ea67f17", "originalString": "400 г"}, {"id": "32a986ee-059e-4950-b72c-40a29f22e78c", "name": "Шпинат", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "953205ce-7302-4436-bfcb-8647baf73269", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "d3ef9fa3-14df-4fa2-b2d6-5a5b1302b835", "name": "Тесто фило", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "10338e2a-df36-4bb3-881f-0011e6828788", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "1ee0eb96-af6b-4530-b06a-cf1d9177254e", "name": "Тунец", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "6457e56a-1d36-4da7-a026-b24d8db824d3", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "751aa417-fa7f-4b04-accb-db43e9ffe561", "name": "Яйца", "unit": "шт", "grams": 275, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "2fc401b0-e772-47dd-bd82-3638f892a36d", "originalString": "5 шт"}, {"id": "88b7b072-7c3d-44d9-bf90-cd85d0fc7fc5", "name": "Острая соус", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "85a99a51-849c-435a-96a8-38a11c49422f", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "a178376e-2e79-46e6-8281-3103e81366d4", "name": 