nd wrap in a clean towel while preparing the remaining flat breads.\r\n\r\nTo eat the bread and sauce, break off pieces of the bread, and scoop them into the sauce. It will slide off, but just keep reaching in!	3	\N	Algerian	["перекус"]	t	https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/72363/algerian-bouzgene-berber-bread-with-roasted-pepper-sauce/	mealdb:53284	[{"id": "b510b6bf-107e-4705-8601-19b93f32085c", "name": "Красный перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "8f4685b1-4b0f-407f-a77e-e4b3205c8ca6", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "632e4265-bb34-4fb3-9c60-dceb10a12d75", "name": "Помидор", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "56af0c35-84c3-4e11-8c83-f306df2b10eb", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "dc2ab34f-83cb-489a-8788-1e8d07e22b20", "name": "Оливковое масло", "unit": "мл", "grams": 165, "amount": 165, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "165 мл"}, {"id": "e9990f96-cac9-4ce9-acb7-789ad37afc89", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "6ba7eeb9-658c-4e9d-8ee7-4f6f6f1631a9", "name": "Халапеньо", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "a6b458f2-fc95-41fc-b321-085216be9987", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "5d417129-69df-435c-b236-c8604ad1f198", "name": "Соль", "unit": "г", "grams": 57.5, "amount": 57.5, "ingredientId": "3789cffa-31e4-49d0-bca4-aded4002f42c", "originalString": "57.5 г"}, {"id": "2c7cf42f-a5f4-4e82-a4c4-8aaffc2b7dcd", "name": "Манка", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "de36e23d-dbd2-4946-aa80-d0b5d73711c6", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "db68f60c-067c-4983-83db-bdf3cecadbb5", "name": "Вода", "unit": "мл", "grams": 720, "amount": 720, "ingredientId": "1eec42eb-3a97-4791-8cb2-da60cef6bc13", "originalString": "720 мл"}]	["vegan", "vegetarian", "lactose-free", "low-carb", "paleo"]	t	\N
67e3951a-3e15-4dde-89f7-6e3b9a61bafc	Завтрак в стиле боксати	breakfast	753	29.4	59	25.4	{лактоза,глютен,яйца,морепродукты}	[{"name": "Картофель", "grams": 150}, {"name": "Зелёный лук", "grams": 75}, {"name": "Пшеничная мука", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Яйцо", "grams": 55}, {"name": "Молоко", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Сода", "grams": 3}, {"name": "Масло", "grams": 180}, {"name": "Растительное масло", "grams": 120}, {"name": "Помидоры черри", "grams": 360}, {"name": "Бекон", "grams": 600}, {"name": "Яйцо", "grams": 55}]	https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/naqyel1608588563.jpg	2026-05-03 20:15:06.642+00	2026-10-06 13:10:30.431+00	["картофель", "карто", "зеленый", "зелен", "лук", "пшеничная", "пшени", "пшеничн", "мука", "яйцо", "молоко", "молок", "сода", "масло", "растительное", "расти", "растительн", "помидоры", "помид", "черри", "бекон"]	STEP 1\r\nBefore you start, put your oven on its lowest setting, ready to keep things warm. Peel the potatoes, grate 2 of them, then set aside. Cut the other 2 into large chunks, then boil for 10-15 mins or until tender. Meanwhile, squeeze as much of the liquid from the grated potatoes as you can using a clean tea towel. Mash the boiled potatoes, then mix with the grated potato, spring onions and flour.\r\n\r\nSTEP 2\r\nWhisk the egg white in a large bowl until it holds soft peaks. Fold in the buttermilk, then add the bicarbonate of soda. Fold into the potato mix.\r\n\r\nSTEP 3\r\nHeat a large non-stick frying pan over a medium heat, then add 1 tbsp butter and some of the oil. Drop 3-4 spoonfuls of the potato mixture into the pan, then gently cook for 3-5 mins on each side until golden and crusty. Keep warm on a plate in the oven while you cook the next batch, adding more butter and oil to the pan before you do so. You will get 16 crumpet-size boxty from the mix. Can be made the day ahead, drained on kitchen paper, then reheated in a low oven for 20 mins.\r\n\r\nSTEP 4\r\nHeat the grill to medium and put the tomatoes in a heavy-based pan. Add a good knob of butter and a little oil, then fry for about 5 mins until softened. Grill the bacon, then pile onto a plate and keep warm. Stack up the boxty, bacon and egg, and serve the tomatoes on the side.	5	\N	Irish	["ужин"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/boxty-bacon-eggs-tomatoes	mealdb:53036	[{"id": "9c2d1abc-ff49-4718-8a6d-88ff64367203", "name": "Картофель", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "99928917-5708-4040-aefa-1a6d06d27937", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "4ddbc73c-4e5a-43bc-aebd-e0fe1a9318bf", "name": "Зелёный лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "e15bcbde-b1b4-4df4-a673-98865ea67f17", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "a88348c2-473a-4172-90fc-9d6fbbd31b03", "name": "Пшеничная мука", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "89fd83a9-9424-4975-a81b-218d640c70a2", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "4c83e2f3-5352-4171-b9a1-96edd78dfa16", "name": "Яйцо", "unit": "шт", "grams": 55, "amount": 1, "ingredientId": "cab42edd-5e3a-4893-839e-9f4ef50c6cf0", "originalString": "1 шт"}, {"id": "0916f68b-843c-4d59-af5d-aeff57bab4ed", "name": "Молоко", "unit": "мл", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "d106cc74-1977-4922-ba5e-2a79a179b0ab", "originalString": "50 мл"}, {"id": "b65a18c8-4419-4684-8694-2cdc08f97a60", "name": "Сода", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "307ad01d-0def-4674-9c61-05932c0ac12b", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "c24d4817-909c-4017-ba6e-cf78c9a4f5c3", "name": "Масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "150 г"}, {"id": "f46e5b83-76fc-4088-b040-922bdacbeab2", "name": "Растительное масло", "unit": "мл", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "f31757af-f603-41e1-ab30-25997e3cdada", "originalString": "100 мл"}, {"id": "e8dd74ba-4bfe-412a-8b71-2dc955bf4e29", "name": "Помидоры черри", "unit": "г", "grams": 300, "amount": 300, "ingredientId": "ff42560f-983