 for around 5 mins, stirring occasionally. Add the red pepper, if using, and cook for another 2 mins, then add the tomatoes and prunes, stir, then increase the heat and boil to reduce slightly, before adding everything to the borscht.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nAdd the shredded cabbage and the kidney beans, and cook for 7-10 mins or until tender. Serve with a dollop of sour cream or cr├иme fra├оche, lots of chopped dill and some crusty bread.	4	\N	Ukrainian	["ужин"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/borsch	mealdb:53311	[{"id": "7a7aace0-4194-46fd-98de-d5e2c1bf2a6d", "name": "Говядина (шинка)", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "40e0d6ae-a33e-489f-bc49-562581dcf3aa", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "de75aa4f-e790-44c1-b9e8-66e5b317b43b", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "c66d3260-56ef-4dd9-88f4-284027ca1b3e", "name": "Лавровый лист", "unit": "шт", "grams": 60, "amount": 1, "ingredientId": "74796ff2-897a-4931-9396-b51b81fda780", "originalString": "1 шт"}, {"id": "1bf19c77-b0d8-4b1e-b57c-8b89457f1c11", "name": "Картофель", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "99928917-5708-4040-aefa-1a6d06d27937", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "4ca899fd-9d8a-4e6e-8f5a-029549f4c83b", "name": "Подсолнечное масло", "unit": "мл", "grams": 30, "amount": 30, "ingredientId": "9c0157c3-cccb-4325-8c3d-5214e3e6b67a", "originalString": "30 мл"}, {"id": "acba42e8-c61b-4a64-8033-1be2cc5bb60b", "name": "Морковь", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "3ab14c63-202a-4334-b30c-9674ce7ef8fd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "c6eccdf4-5e58-4663-8d5b-2463a5e2d1e2", "name": "Свёкла", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "183082d8-2483-4d9b-a446-320d4671ff15", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "c7b11542-ea04-4003-afc1-008b2c9c0a2d", "name": "Красный перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "8f4