 noodles to the wok\r\nNext add sherry cooking wine, oyster sauce, sugar, vinegar, sesame seed oil, 1 pinch white pepper, and soy sauce\r\nAdd back in the shrimp\r\nTo thicken the sauce, whisk together 1 Tablespoon of corn starch and 2 Tablespoon of water in a bowl and slowly add to your stir-fry until it's the right thickness.	5	\N	Chinese	["ужин"]	t	https://sueandgambo.com/pages/shrimp-chow-fun	mealdb:52953	[{"id": "7a45ce12-2cb3-4851-a939-2304f60b7617", "name": "Рисовая лапша", "unit": "г", "grams": 25, "amount": 25, "ingredientId": "3312643e-6ac8-4e59-ba04-6b561db90e10", "originalString": "25 г"}, {"id": "be4312ac-3b49-44ff-9458-8f6a19eaa885", "name": "Креветки", "unit": "г", "grams": 400, "amount": 400, "ingredientId": "217c513d-310e-4472-adf1-8dc55e9df4bf", "originalString": "400 г"}, {"id": "856ae3c5-c8a5-4e8e-9479-c789873801d3", "name": "Яйцо", "unit": "г", "grams": 25, "amount": 25, "ingredientId": "cab42edd-5e3a-4893-839e-9f4ef50c6cf0", "originalString": "25 г"}, {"id": "829e1541-3b8c-403e-b639-b6debbe79949", "name": "Перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 0.5, "amount": 0.5, "ingredientId": "01a35a87-6c12-4f1b-87cf-323571bc15cd", "originalString": "0.5 г"}, {"id": "d072a1d4-6d5c-490f-94e4-72b1210a733a", "name": "Масло кунжутное", "unit": "г", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "d2f58ade-dce8-4322-a06f-d5882f76ae63", "originalString": "10 г"}, {"id": "08094532-8dae-4893-bbc4-276117640c78", "name": "Кукурузный крахмал", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "41137d44-eccd-4d8e-b985-ca171a3b3a50", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "ecb2aa91-a2ca-4724-a5cf-7c23e611e178", "name": "Масло растительное", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "5b108e38-f71a-4947-86c8-21376908b7dd", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "7a1f43d8-b3a9-4758-aad0-4b5618a538a0", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "04b0e9f6-c14a-49f0-a485-b1