ge in a row. Coat the chicken breasts in flour, then dip them into the egg, then coat in breadcrumbs, making sure you cover both sides.\r\nHeat oil in large frying pan over medium-high heat. Place chicken into hot oil and cook until golden brown, about 3 or 4 minutes each side. Once cooked, place on kitchen paper to absorb excess oil.\r\nPour curry sauce over chicken, serve with white rice and enjoy!	4	\N	Japanese	["ужин"]	t	http://allrecipes.co.uk/recipe/29578/chicken-katsu-curry.aspx	mealdb:52820	[{"id": "256b5a82-2d52-4486-b2d7-c1436752d1c3", "name": "Куриная грудка", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "12c12878-ea46-4858-9358-8795cf84fcbb", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "d2c1b3f5-b464-4218-94b2-5935309f791b", "name": "Пшеничная мука", "unit": "г", "grams": 60, "amount": 60, "ingredientId": "89fd83a9-9424-4975-a81b-218d640c70a2", "originalString": "60 г"}, {"id": "3af475a3-8cce-4613-ac6f-5715bfa8fc35", "name": "Яйцо", "unit": "шт", "grams": 55, "amount": 1, "ingredientId": "cab42edd-5e3a-4893-839e-9f4ef50c6cf0", "originalString": "1 шт"}, {"id": "33c0bd5e-e262-450d-915b-a0dfd0980bca", "name": "Панировочные сухари", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "e63f09a5-d79c-4418-b16d-48ff3f8ad5e5", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "09a8ab40-526b-454b-8e71-cf0d8186117e", "name": "Растительное масло", "unit": "мл", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "f31757af-f603-41e1-ab30-25997e3cdada", "originalString": "50 мл"}, {"id": "38b15606-0cd6-45d0-b0d7-ec4f16bcca01", "name": "Подсолнечное масло", "unit": "мл", "grams": 30, "amount": 30, "ingredientId": "9c0157c3-cccb-4325-8c3d-5214e3e6b67a", "originalString": "30 мл"}, {"id": "cf12f398-c176-46da-8511-417e1e6f612b", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "2d40cad8-c7e3-4bf4-ac4a-56d9a04895a1", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 250, "amount": 250, "ingredientId"