lling.\r\n\r\nCarefully lay the potatoes on top of the hot-pot filling, overlapping them slightly, almost like a pie top.\r\n\r\nBrush the potatoes with a little melted butter and cook in the oven for about 35 mins. The hot-pot is ready once the potatoes are cooked and golden brown.	3	\N	British	["ужин"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/chicken-mushroom-hot-pot	mealdb:52846	[{"id": "0860ff08-6ed9-4eec-8f04-588f19af8e93", "name": "Масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "9a4df3b1-5756-4d25-b7af-06104983a41d", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "019dde95-eabd-4433-8f89-fc981db5694f", "name": "Грибы", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "97f04ffa-f6a9-4e22-b285-58e2a13b33b0", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "e2529891-b85d-4902-8111-ee8595c1b820", "name": "Пшеничная мука", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "89fd83a9-9424-4975-a81b-218d640c70a2", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "4dfd30f9-7fa0-4b1a-b542-20e6bc0315bd", "name": "Куриный бульон (кубик)", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "a30054e1-4904-4166-9c1c-b575c470e4a0", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "43967050-6598-4650-a238-7cd3e49bf7d3", "name": "Мускатный орех", "unit": "г", "grams": 0.5, "amount": 0.5, "ingredientId": "fbd011f6-270f-40bb-8cbb-68bcac3551bc", "originalString": "0.5 г"}, {"id": "b047ab45-599b-4605-a1fa-c6bf76ea3fba", "name": "Порошок горчицы", "unit": "г", "grams": 0.5, "amount": 0.5, "ingredientId": "59d7defa-257e-4f2d-89d4-722645cd0d78", "originalString": "0.5 г"}, {"id": "262e6232-3a6c-4401-b0e4-ac77c9b8c5dd", "name": "Курица", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "fde4920d-1aea-40db-ab56-10941a2d8d85", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "f3a4a10c-62ae-4fb5-86fe-b8f805026458", "name": "Кукуруза", "