s in the egg, then turn to coat in the breadcrumbs. At this point, the raw croquetas can be frozen for up to three months. Pour the oil into a large, deep pan ensuring it is no more than a third full and heat to 170C, or until a cube of bread browns lightly in 30 seconds. Fry the croquetas in batches for 2-3 mins until deeply golden. To cook from frozen, fry at 160C for a few minutes longer until theyтАЩre piping hot inside. Remove to a sheet of kitchen paper using a slotted spoon and leave to drain. Serve warm with a glass of sherry.	1	\N	Spanish	["ужин"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/jamon-wild-garlic-croquetas	mealdb:53145	[{"id": "22580b2c-ffc9-475d-87b2-fdba39b38298", "name": "Дикий чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "cc76425f-d060-4cd1-9a4b-22b642b7a2d5", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "3c169a09-0667-4325-bc75-febf77c8c0a1", "name": "Молоко", "unit": "мл", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "d106cc74-1977-4922-ba5e-2a79a179b0ab", "originalString": "50 мл"}, {"id": "5bdeb6b9-ad9b-4141-a256-ed8876d7ffb9", "name": "Оливковое масло", "unit": "мл", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "50 мл"}, {"id": "e834fa09-427c-4692-a055-8be992829584", "name": "Мука", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "6b9d37d6-50b6-41f6-bc22-2376d8109821", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "1bd7f3a5-8c6c-4329-971f-55e3f635e9c0", "name": "Манчего", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "3a72b249-32cb-46a2-9cab-7a9778bea1ab", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "9a3b2c58-5e7d-4bc2-be7c-c178b976d328", "name": "Иберийское варенье", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "83646322-2dc9-47ee-9683-5bc82116ca6d", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "26a6f611-22d3-40e6-a90b-50d5635791da", "name": "Яйцо", "unit": "шт", "grams": 2500, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "cab42edd-5e3a-4893-839e-9f4ef50c6cf0", "originalString": "50 шт"}, {"id": "9