of one package anchovies; cook briefly, turning, until crisp. Remove with a slotted spoon and place on paper towels. Discard oil. Wipe out skillet.\r\n\r\n Step 4\r\nHeat 2 tablespoons oil in the skillet. Stir in the onion, garlic, and shallots; cook until fragrant, about 1 or 2 minutes. Mix in the chile paste, and cook for 10 minutes, stirring occasionally. If the chile paste is too dry, add a small amount of water. Stir in remaining anchovies; cook for 5 minutes. Stir in salt, sugar, and tamarind juice; simmer until sauce is thick, about 5 minutes.\r\n\r\n Step 5\r\nServe the onion and garlic sauce over the warm rice, and top with peanuts, fried anchovies, cucumbers, and eggs.	7	\N	Malaysian	["ужин"]	t	https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/78938/malaysian-nasi-lemak/	mealdb:53051	[{"id": "187fc43d-a4a8-4a7b-b826-54743ec45636", "name": "Кокосовое молоко", "unit": "мл", "grams": 480, "amount": 480, "ingredientId": "5b412dd6-93d5-4ab2-92c1-3700bee8c60f", "originalString": "480 мл"}, {"id": "8897c46a-c83d-4c50-919b-694ad6907d94", "name": "Вода", "unit": "мл", "grams": 480, "amount": 480, "ingredientId": "1eec42eb-3a97-4791-8cb2-da60cef6bc13", "originalString": "480 мл"}, {"id": "3285ca9c-dfb9-4dfd-a128-8d6faf802f5c", "name": "Имбирь паста", "unit": "г", "grams": 1.3, "amount": 1.3, "ingredientId": "acd3b6d8-612f-45ec-b7ee-48128324721c", "originalString": "1.3 г"}, {"id": "9c653502-b296-48ca-9626-ae27f14ec8d9", "name": "Имбирь", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "245533a8-d5cb-4feb-9254-2f888a3b4f85", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "f05c22bc-6a8d-4bb1-a986-7d49f8b21c0f", "name": "Лавровый лист", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "74796ff2-897a-4931-9396-b51b81fda780", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "1a6b63b5-1fc4-48a7-a4af-efaae1017743", "name": "Рис", "unit": "г", "grams": 480, "amount": 480, "ingredientId": "57918e00-5715-4589-ba23-9521a39cdd7b", "originalString": "480 г"}, {"id": "82607813-6d86-4b28-a262-9611e0872dec"