st to make it more pliable) and fill with baking beans. Blind-bake for 15-20 mins until the sides are set, then remove the parchment and beans and return to the oven for 5 mins until golden brown. Trim the pastry so itтАЩs flush with the top of the tin тАУ a small serrated knife is best for this. If there are any cracks, patch them up with the pastry scraps.\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, weigh the butter, syrup and sugars into a pan, and add 1 /4 tsp salt. Heat until the butter has melted and the sugar dissolved, stirring until smooth. Remove from the heat and cool for 10 mins. Reduce oven to 160C/140C fan/gas 3.\r\n\r\nBeat the eggs in a bowl. Add the syrup mixture, vanilla and pecans, and mix until well combined. Pour half the mixture into the tart case, scatter over half the chocolate chips, then cover with the remaining filling and chocolate chips. Bake on the middle shelf for 50-55 mins until set. Remove from the oven and leave to cool, then chill for at least 2 hrs before serving.	3	\N	United States	["перекус"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/choc-chip-pecan-pie	mealdb:52856	[{"id": "a46a9a89-5f8c-46f5-823c-bb382b807bff", "name": "Пшеничная мука", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "89fd83a9-9424-4975-a81b-218d640c70a2", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "98db751a-1665-46e2-b87e-c7923541a642", "name": "Масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "1360ac93-7468-4003-8bc9-e2050f30d432", "name": "Сливочный сыр", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "22dc850e-3571-4cb4-9322-90e70cedaa00", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "ba9f73ba-5325-4add-8985-8a2cd8d2a2e8", "name": "Сахарная пудра", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "0ae3eca4-e36e-42f4-ae8e-a3f42bcb8501", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "991013cd-f452-4dd8-a0b4-dac2904ceb72", "name": "Кленовый сироп", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "580