fbe17d29-c673-4046-8b7d-f00bf6a89d88	Булочки с корицей (fbe17d29)	lunch	787	16.6	21.9	133.2	{лактоза,глютен,яйца}	[{"name": "Пшеничная мука", "grams": 480}, {"name": "Соль", "grams": 5}, {"name": "Дрожжи", "grams": 3}, {"name": "Молоко", "grams": 180}, {"name": "Масло", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Яйца", "grams": 55}, {"name": "Растительное масло", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Коричневый сахар", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Корица", "grams": 3}, {"name": "Сушёные фрукты", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Сахарная пудра", "grams": 120}]	https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/vqpwrv1511723001.jpg	2026-05-03 20:14:32.24+00	2026-10-06 13:02:27.435+00	["пшеничная", "пшени", "пшеничн", "мука", "соль", "дрожжи", "дрожж", "молоко", "молок", "масло", "яйца", "растительное", "расти", "растительн", "коричневый", "корич", "коричнев", "сахар", "корица", "кориц", "сушеные", "сушен", "фрукты", "фрукт", "сахарная", "сахарн", "пудра"]	Sift the flour and salt into a large bowl. Make a well in the middle and add the yeast.\r\nMeanwhile, warm the milk and butter in a saucepan until the butter melts and the mixture is lukewarm.\r\nAdd the milk mixture and egg to the flour mixture and stir until the contents of the bowl come together as a soft dough. (You may need to add a little extra flour.)\r\nTip the dough onto a generously floured work surface. Knead for five minutes, adding more flour if necessary, until the dough is smooth and elastic and no longer feels sticky.\r\nLightly oil a bowl with a little of the vegetable oil. Place the dough into the bowl and turn until it is covered in the oil. Cover the bowl with cling film and set aside in a warm place for one hour, or until the dough has doubled in size.\r\nLightly grease a baking tray.\r\nFor the filling, knock the dough back to its original size and turn out onto a lightly floured work surface. Roll the dough out into a rectangle 0.5cm/┬╝in thick. Brush all over with the melted butter, then sprinkle over the brown sugar, cinnamon and dried fruit.\r\nRoll the dough up into a tight cylinder , cut ten 4cm/1┬╜in slice and place them onto a lightly greased baking sheet, leaving a little space between each slice. Cover with a tea towel and set aside to rise for 30 minutes.\r\nPreheat oven to 190C/375F/Gas 5.\r\nBake the buns in the oven for 20-25 minutes, or until risen and golden-brown.\r\nMeanwhile, for the glaze, heat the milk and sugar in a saucepan until boiling. Reduce the heat and simmer for 2-3 minutes.\r\nRemove the buns from the oven and brush with the glaze, then set aside to cool on a wire rack.	4	\N	British	["перекус"]	t	https://www.bbc.co.uk/food/recipes/chelsea_buns_95015	mealdb:52898	[{"id": "15b83a79-0e56-477c-a220-d1b0bf10d1b9", "name": "Пшеничная мука", "unit": "г", "grams": 500, "amount": 500, "ingredientId": "89fd83a9-9424-4975-a81b-218d640c70a2", "originalString": "500 г"}, {"id": "50f7a130-f978-4740-9c10-b668b8e24d39", "name": "Соль", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "3789cffa-31e4-49d0-bca4-aded4002f42c", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "a926f2ab-f321-434a-9de7-a32ae21ecda6", "name": "Дрожжи", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "8173f05b-53c4-4ba6-a714-740bc2534450", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "2d7a02f2-6db3-4cdd-90c1-8d94dc1bd893", "name": "Молоко", "unit": "мл", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "d106cc74-1977-4922-ba5e-2a79a179b0ab", "originalString": "150 мл"}, {"id": "002f8012-b3cc-400b-8fe7-423c649b9b4a", "name": "Масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "d7d98e89-a189-46ae-854b-eeb19db7d09f", "name": "Яйца", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "2fc401b0-e772-47dd-bd82-3638f892a36d", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "0ec16882-91db-4a36-a20c-5c2a1042d828", "name": "Растительное масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "f31757af-f603-41e1-ab30-25997e3cdada", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id