38164968-ae55-4a7d-ac1d-d90342d03214	Крокеты с ветчиной	lunch	636	11.8	47.3	42.3	{лактоза,глютен,яйца,орехи}	[{"name": "Пшеничная мука", "grams": 120}, {"name": "Яйцо", "grams": 55}, {"name": "Панировочные сухари", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Подсолнечное масло", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Оливковое масло экстра вёрджин", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Лук-порей", "grams": 75}, {"name": "Ветчина", "grams": 40}, {"name": "Овощной бульон", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Молоко", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Мускатный орех", "grams": 5}]	https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/6dpa7m1763331105.jpg	2026-05-03 20:15:08.89+00	2026-10-06 13:02:27.226+00	["пшеничная", "пшени", "пшеничн", "мука", "яйцо", "панировочные", "панир", "панировочн", "сухари", "сухар", "подсолнечное", "подсо", "подсолнечн", "масло", "оливковое", "оливк", "оливков", "экстра", "экстр", "верджин", "вердж", "лук", "порей", "пор", "ветчина", "ветчи", "овощной", "овощн", "бульон", "бульо", "молоко", "молок", "мускатный", "муска", "мускатн", "орех"]	step 1\r\nTo make the filling, heat the olive oil in a pan until it starts to shimmer. Add the leek and saut├й until soft but not coloured. Stir in the ham with a wooden spoon, fry for 1 min, then stir in the flour and fry over a medium heat, stirring occasionally, until the mixture is golden but not burnt тАУ this will take about 5 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nMeanwhile, combine the stock and milk in a small pan and heat until steaming but not boiling. Season with a few scrapes of nutmeg. Gradually add the liquid, a few tbsp at a time, stirring constantly.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nOnce youтАЩve incorporated all the milk stock, continue to cook the filling over a medium heat for about 10 mins or until it thickens and leaves the sides of the pan when you stir it.\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nSeason with black pepper, taste and adjust the salt if necessary тАУ the ham can be very salty to start with. The filling is now done: it has to be really thick because you donтАЩt want the croquetas to turn into pancakes.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nSmooth the mixture onto a baking tray (30 x 20cm is fine). Once it has stopped steaming, cover with cling film to stop it drying out. Leave to cool before putting it in the fridge for 1 hr.\r\n\r\nstep 6\r\nWhen you're ready for the next stage, line up three bowls: the first filled with the flour, the second with beaten egg and the third with breadcrumbs. Take the ham mixture out of the fridge. Put a little bit of olive oil on your hands to make it easier to roll the croquetas.\r\n\r\nstep 7\r\nRoll a spoonful of the mixture between your palms. The size and shape of the croquetas is up to you, but the easiest is a walnut-sized ball. Then begin coating as follows.\r\n\r\nstep 8\r\nDunk the croquetas into the flour тАУ you want a dusting тАУ followed by the egg, then the breadcrumbs. Put them on a tray and, when youтАЩve used up all the mixture, place in the fridge for 30 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 9\r\nIf you have a deep-fat fryer, heat the oil to 180C and fry for a couple of mins. If not, heat the oil in a deep, heavy-bottomed saucepan until it starts to shimmer. Then add 5-6 croquetas at a time and fry until golden all over. Once cooked, drain on kitchen paper and eat straight away.	3	\N	Spanish	["ужин"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/ham-croquetas	mealdb:53179	[{"id": "21619c83-7f8b-4603-a89e-9943baac2d79", "name": "Пшеничная мука", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "89fd83a9-9424-4975-a81b-218d640c70a2", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "7318c1cf-e857-4d34-a529-fef9ce764f06", "name": "Яйцо", "unit": "шт", "grams": 55, "amount": 1, "ingredientId": "cab42edd-5e3a-4893-839e-9f4ef50c6cf0", "originalString": "1 шт"}, {"id": "68969004-ede8-4993-8b4b-f4e384a8b018", "name": "Панировочные сухари", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "e63f09a5-d79c-4418-b16d-48ff3f8ad5e5", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "ae3c2bce-c6d9-403f-a602-ffc10b37bd2a", "name": "Подсолнечное масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount":