rm a thick dough.\r\n\r\nWith floured hands, roll spoonfuls of the dough into small balls.\r\n\r\nAfter two hours, remove the lid from the stew and place the balls on top of the stew. Cover, return to the oven and cook for a further 20 minutes, or until the dumplings have swollen and are tender. (If you prefer your dumplings with a golden top, leave the lid off when returning to the oven.)\r\n\r\nTo serve, place a spoonful of mashed potato onto each of four serving plates and top with the stew and dumplings. Sprinkle with chopped parsley.	4	\N	British	["ужин"]	t	https://www.bbc.co.uk/food/recipes/beefstewwithdumpling_87333	mealdb:52873	[{"id": "ca66cdce-71f2-4a80-8de1-d292aee40c54", "name": "Оливковое масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "e42c6fb8-3b30-4245-a11c-4ed274202c81", "name": "Масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "9f07a994-7781-407d-8303-4a7302836c0f", "name": "Говядина", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "6faa9697-3013-4635-a452-09e75c62051a", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "0910d1a1-4a1b-4fa0-be2d-a12bf1afb9c6", "name": "Пшеничная мука", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "89fd83a9-9424-4975-a81b-218d640c70a2", "originalString": "150 г"}, {"id": "68e2b936-bffd-45fa-bbc9-f1fcb8759a3d", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "3d161b63-d35b-4cb9-8671-0383ae257f83", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "77e34105-2e7f-48f9-8410-0bbc5b2781ce", "name": "Сельдерей", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "a4b7203e-cf47-4297-8829-4be3c7270d19", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "6793