er, add the garlic to the pan, and fry for an additional 30 seconds to 1 minute until no longer pink.\r\n\r\nAdd the sauce, cornstarch, and broccoli:\r\nPour in the sauce and the cornstarch slurry (1 teaspoon cornstarch dissolved in 1 tablespoon of water). Stir until the sauce boils and thickens, about 30 seconds. Stir in the broccoli.\r\n\r\nServe immediately, with steamed rice or on its own.	3	\N	Chinese	["ужин"]	t	https://www.simplyrecipes.com/recipes/broccoli_beef/	mealdb:53366	[{"id": "3e6178f8-e346-4e6c-b8ca-de191f0ae0a7", "name": "Соевый соус", "unit": "мл", "grams": 20, "amount": 20, "ingredientId": "f4b21455-e4d4-4a4c-8406-5f5b1519b201", "originalString": "20 мл"}, {"id": "db99770f-275d-4cc8-ac5b-7254c92f5534", "name": "Сухой херес", "unit": "мл", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "93e2d879-bfe6-44cb-931c-47770466e99c", "originalString": "10 мл"}, {"id": "be99644b-9306-4bd9-913b-e938c71c69b0", "name": "Крахмал", "unit": "г", "grams": 7.5, "amount": 7.5, "ingredientId": "5bdee241-6014-4beb-860d-bffae26ac020", "originalString": "7.5 г"}, {"id": "fd82f225-d987-45cb-b110-536f40fa8bb8", "name": "Чёрный перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 0.6, "amount": 0.6, "ingredientId": "f0e5f8a6-efb8-41db-8bf4-098aea77ef76", "originalString": "0.6 г"}, {"id": "0de40dc9-bf2d-49d0-a9e2-ed7b993bebd5", "name": "Стейк из тонкой части говядины", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "063860c0-e9ac-4311-bc9f-c5433ce1f850", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "bfc57482-6971-4faf-85e5-72f7728e6588", "name": "Устричный соус", "unit": "мл", "grams": 30, "amount": 30, "ingredientId": "cf336256-9320-4467-b318-f493d50e8c0d", "originalString": "30 мл"}, {"id": "58e15106-1882-47ad-a247-3d6f216b2eb0", "name": "Куриный бульон", "unit": "мл", "grams": 60, "amount": 60, "ingredientId": "91e363d7-dd45-4ec9-9fec-998b79337f1d", "originalString": "60 мл"}, {"id": "c43f097e-be04-4527-8e79-592b20d9025b", "name": "Брокколи", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4