poons oil and sprinkle with Parmesan.\r\nPut the pot in the oven and bake until the bread, onions and cheese are browned and crisp, 10 to 15 minutes. (If your pot fits under the broiler, you can also brown the top there.) Divide the soup and bread among 4 bowls and serve.	2	\N	Italian	["ужин"]	t	https://cooking.nytimes.com/recipes/1016052-ribollita	mealdb:52811	[{"id": "70d2cd03-9968-4859-8b72-2df4e6c2055d", "name": "Оливковое масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 75, "amount": 75, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "75 г"}, {"id": "f8eb7bf7-079f-48f0-9db7-d4c88d39615e", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "5db4353d-3804-44aa-9f50-224251561d2e", "name": "Морковь", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "3ab14c63-202a-4334-b30c-9674ce7ef8fd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "0688cf64-97e3-42e1-8d00-a7ad25e0bd97", "name": "Сельдерей", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "a4b7203e-cf47-4297-8829-4be3c7270d19", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "c4a53cdb-cdb1-45ca-a5fa-ca3f3abdebc0", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 15, "amount": 15, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "15 г"}, {"id": "3b5db95a-d11e-4cd0-966a-fc7eb581457f", "name": "Фасоль каннеллини", "unit": "г", "grams": 480, "amount": 480, "ingredientId": "6d7dc609-ae02-44e4-9c0d-9c2b4e7905e6", "originalString": "480 г"}, {"id": "76790ec2-2475-4453-a01c-f20def892d86", "name": "Консервированные помидоры", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "c1d0f255-edb3-45d4-937c-957674598a09", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "7f1afd76-b266-42cd-8ba7-3456d47fa621", "name": "Вода", "unit": "мл", "grams": 960, "amount": 960, "ingredientId": "1eec42eb-3a97-4791-8cb2-da60cef6bc13", "originalString": "960 мл"}, {"id": "b971cc9c-ddda-4a55-8735-f8c242081a99", "name": "Розмарин", "unit": "г", "gram