beans, coconut milk, water, salt, allspice, and black pepper and stir until combined. Lay thyme on top. Bring mixture to a simmer.\r\nCover with a lid and reduce heat to low. Allow to cook for 18 minutes over low heat, then remove from heat. Leave the lid on for an additional 5 minutes.\r\nOpen the lid and remove the thyme. Fluff rice with fork. Enjoy.	3	\N	Jamaican	["ужин"]	t	https://www.myforkinglife.com/jamaican-instant-pot-rice-and-beans/#recipe	mealdb:53352	[{"id": "d360fb29-699d-4000-92f6-4a655246002c", "name": "Оливковое масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 15, "amount": 15, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "15 г"}, {"id": "aea3f939-ab15-4584-be8f-021b517316f6", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "56303898-a873-406f-851e-e7ac178d28bc", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "d0f4d502-727f-4078-80af-74db41fd003c", "name": "Зелёный лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "e15bcbde-b1b4-4df4-a673-98865ea67f17", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "e5945fb6-e2f4-4568-99fa-acadf9da856b", "name": "Рис", "unit": "г", "grams": 480, "amount": 480, "ingredientId": "57918e00-5715-4589-ba23-9521a39cdd7b", "originalString": "480 г"}, {"id": "ebd8310f-5867-4c87-a3c1-8457c4720eab", "name": "Кокосовое молоко", "unit": "мл", "grams": 180, "amount": 180, "ingredientId": "5b412dd6-93d5-4ab2-92c1-3700bee8c60f", "originalString": "180 мл"}, {"id": "46681a8a-3438-4331-bf92-6ccbb55f5b5b", "name": "Вода", "unit": "мл", "grams": 180, "amount": 180, "ingredientId": "1eec42eb-3a97-4791-8cb2-da60cef6bc13", "originalString": "180 мл"}, {"id": "6340827f-f620-46e5-ac36-b546471a81cc", "name": "Соль", "unit": "г", "grams": 7.5, "amount": 7.5, "ingredientId": "3789cffa-31e4-49d0-bca4-aded4002f42c", "originalString": "7.5 