ar.\r\n4. Any left over paste could be stored in the fridge for future use.\r\n5. Cinnamon could be avoided as it's a strong spice used generally for meat or chicken.	6	\N	India	["ужин"]	t	http://www.flavorsofmumbai.com/fish-recheado-masala-recipe/	mealdb:52809	[{"id": "80a9befd-cdd2-4301-9d94-21ceae608adb", "name": "Скумбрия", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "f88346ba-8e56-451b-a6e4-87fd213173a0", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "4ab6053a-0170-4055-8b16-5c8a1da0811f", "name": "Красный чили", "unit": "г", "grams": 900, "amount": 900, "ingredientId": "1bdf28f1-5237-485b-956d-fc1a25d21656", "originalString": "900 г"}, {"id": "7f7b543a-4129-40d8-9aa3-5d55c1fbcd2f", "name": "Имбирь", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "245533a8-d5cb-4feb-9254-2f888a3b4f85", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "78188ace-5551-4654-9ea2-f752ce3574b4", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 400, "amount": 400, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "400 г"}, {"id": "c4f6f541-48bc-429b-bf2a-6edca9f097af", "name": "Перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 7.5, "amount": 7.5, "ingredientId": "01a35a87-6c12-4f1b-87cf-323571bc15cd", "originalString": "7.5 г"}, {"id": "6ba7c377-bcbb-4613-ac7f-ce8e98588ef1", "name": "Тмин", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "d3ebda74-17c3-45b6-8ddd-82a44f0d652e", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "3bcffc1e-86c0-43af-abb6-0fba166a36b0", "name": "Куркума", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "e9900362-e715-4c27-a1a7-e7f4837aec69", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "2d3235fc-c510-466d-88c2-a73e17d1f11c", "name": "Корица", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "c508be3b-b158-45c7-9a46-2326abea13d0", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "46ecf006-4282-4956-9f94-9049ca08235b", "name": "Гвоздика", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "dfbbaba4-1f1d-40e2-949c-06b7a6a78217", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "f641cee4-448f-45c