ream.\r\n04.Preheat the oven to 190┬░C/fan170┬░C/gas 5. Grate the artichokes and add to the dish with the leek, prawns and herbs. Stir the lemon zest and juice into the sauce, then pour over. Mix gently with a wooden spoon.\r\n05.Spoon the mash onto the fish mixture, then use a fork to make peaks, which will crisp and brown as it cooks. Sprinkle over the cheese, then bake for 35-40 minutes until golden and bubbling. Serve with wilted greens.	3	\N	British	["ужин"]	t	\N	mealdb:52802	[{"id": "a100ac31-12e5-4d61-aab2-f0e30abf4eff", "name": "Картофель", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "99928917-5708-4040-aefa-1a6d06d27937", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "dbca4085-1242-403d-b565-70fc9d903133", "name": "Оливковое масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 30, "amount": 30, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "30 г"}, {"id": "b10bfa03-614d-4cf4-8426-3bcdd1aae54b", "name": "Молоко наполовину обезжиренное", "unit": "мл", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "b3cf2b93-ba4b-4272-9ed5-490cf0899979", "originalString": "50 мл"}, {"id": "8790aa7c-6eb7-4812-a0e0-8193378d63b7", "name": "Филе белой рыбы", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "e2a0742e-1e2a-4788-9dd4-84a92d6fe63d", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "ee57084d-3591-4858-aae7-bc85c3890ff5", "name": "Пшеничная мука", "unit": "г", "grams": 15, "amount": 15, "ingredientId": "89fd83a9-9424-4975-a81b-218d640c70a2", "originalString": "15 г"}, {"id": "0c3e1700-898e-4cda-b435-d83ea60126d2", "name": "Мускатный орех", "unit": "г", "grams": 2.5, "amount": 2.5, "ingredientId": "fbd011f6-270f-40bb-8cbb-68bcac3551bc", "originalString": "2.5 г"}, {"id": "18de465a-a462-4cf0-963c-e6d96855bac8", "name": "Густые сливки", "unit": "мл", "grams": 45, "amount": 45, "ingredientId": "bbff168c-afd7-44e8-98cf-111d7e0af483", "originalString": "45 мл"}, {"id": "8dcc08bf-b006-4844-8a71-9353a85e7e62", "name": "Артишоки", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId":