oup. Simmer until soft, about 15 minutes. Remove celery stalk and discard. Sprinkle soup with remaining 1/2 cilantro and remaining 1/2 mint before serving.	7	\N	Algerian	["ужин"]	t	https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/264552/chorba-hamra-bel-frik-algerian-lamb-tomato-and-freekeh-soup/	mealdb:53289	[{"id": "18312db3-d156-44a2-b71f-6700a430086f", "name": "Фрике", "unit": "г", "grams": 240, "amount": 240, "ingredientId": "c6cd00a6-2fc9-4177-b059-4ffb1c7a5bb9", "originalString": "240 г"}, {"id": "3b99d974-f905-4965-a000-291df33e0615", "name": "Баранина", "unit": "г", "grams": 600, "amount": 600, "ingredientId": "592dc5ae-f7ea-4cb8-b6db-bb6600636bd4", "originalString": "600 г"}, {"id": "b5001fac-175c-44f1-a4f6-ac9869354ecb", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "b1836cf7-e2a1-474c-a9c3-f18fb729d25d", "name": "Чёрный перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "f0e5f8a6-efb8-41db-8bf4-098aea77ef76", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "51546673-7736-4449-99d1-2797d1b7085d", "name": "Паприка", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "85045806-3a18-4d35-ad01-0230c0cb98d2", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "2072f7fb-e857-4207-ba08-f56ec666752b", "name": "Молотая корица", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "bd59c7c9-4302-46cc-9554-f9762887d074", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "45c78087-c4a5-4b35-855b-71f6b7e1cafb", "name": "Соль", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "3789cffa-31e4-49d0-bca4-aded4002f42c", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "daba128f-cb0c-4b0e-8546-dfbf0094dc1d", "name": "Растительное масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 45, "amount": 45, "ingredientId": "f31757af-f603-41e1-ab30-25997e3cdada", "originalString": "45 г"}, {"id": "892a380b-fc9f-4c04-80de-323e2bd95690", "name": "Кинза", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "91b7fcb8-7a96-438b-8f70-bca57c96e463", "originalString": "