 Big Mac sauce, onion, lettuce, pickles, beef patty and then finish with more sauce. Top with burger lid to serve.\r\n5. After waiting half an hour for your food to settle, go for a jog.	5	\N	United States	["ужин"]	t	https://www.delicious.com.au/recipes/finally-recipe-worlds-top-selling-burger-big-mac/5221ee4a-279e-4a0b-8629-f442dc46822e	mealdb:53013	[{"id": "cca67b6f-689f-45ab-92d3-31af4ac5b4bd", "name": "Говяжий фарш", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "15229283-665a-43f5-8bb0-69faf5749d2f", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "98486138-d025-4281-a4eb-38a6becb8176", "name": "Оливковое масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "4e179672-3f22-4469-b54b-e0e86d6447ed", "name": "Булочки с кунжутом", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "7c9b3727-70ae-49bb-8b78-e04a3c01680c", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "2cbab455-f365-4241-8f60-4e88ee7a99fb", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "63ebb21a-a254-4cfb-ba31-e9d3d858ccbc", "name": "Салат айсберг", "unit": "г", "grams": 12.5, "amount": 12.5, "ingredientId": "f7c50e49-20e2-4f70-b264-9f979fd2ed7d", "originalString": "12.5 г"}, {"id": "3602adc9-e981-41c2-b46c-afee6c4edcdf", "name": "Сыр", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "f66ba678-5b96-4051-9194-87c34ad371d8", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "6472af3f-9f9f-4e38-ad07-233b38a42f55", "name": "Маринованные огурцы", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "fe329613-6f2c-4326-86c4-8b85306fee25", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "ba1925c2-6301-43a9-a050-4c2c49057977", "name": "Майонез", "unit": "г", "grams": 240, "amount": 240, "ingredientId": "f346eb0c-92b1-46f4-b9d1-d9ca8719f1ed", "originalString": "240 г"}, {"id": "65af31c4-8aee-4b79-97e1-929b89d67260", "name": "Белый винный уксус", "u