d, about 3 minutes per side. Transfer to a plate with pork.\r\n6. Pour 1┬╜ cups of water into the pot and scrape up browned bits from the bottom with a wooden spoon. Add remaining garlic, 3 Tbsp. coconut vinegar or unseasoned rice vinegar, 2 Tbsp. soy sauce, 2 bay leaves, 1 tsp. freshly ground black pepper, and remaining 1 Tbsp. sugar. Bring to a simmer, then return pork and eggplant to pot. Reduce heat to medium-low, partially cover, and simmer until eggplant is tender and silky and sauce is reduced by half, 20тАУ25 minutes. Taste and season with more salt and pepper and add a little more sugar if needed.\r\n7. Top with garlic chips and serve with cooked white rice.	4	\N	Filipino	["ужин"]	t	https://salu-salo.com/eggplant-adobo/	mealdb:53073	[{"id": "144e8857-b8b8-4302-8119-1a0bff66dacb", "name": "Яйцо", "unit": "шт", "grams": 55, "amount": 1, "ingredientId": "cab42edd-5e3a-4893-839e-9f4ef50c6cf0", "originalString": "1 шт"}, {"id": "4a90bd7f-b2ad-4bd3-a1ca-3ffb47cd8f4a", "name": "Сахар", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "f686d932-ccf2-4d50-9f23-2e0375fdd9d4", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "16dde3fb-e184-4b68-b38a-04f743cdfdda", "name": "Соль", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "3789cffa-31e4-49d0-bca4-aded4002f42c", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "6d90d507-ab90-4454-a3d3-31e5ac90c4b6", "name": "Перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "01a35a87-6c12-4f1b-87cf-323571bc15cd", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "05d74c30-12ef-438e-96c0-d35fee419ca6", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "2b0b9fb4-8858-433b-bb70-df49aa1652f7", "name": "Оливковое масло", "unit": "мл", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "150 мл"}, {"id": "5dc91e36-e676-4999-a163-ee76b3981e34", "name": "Говяжий фарш", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "