ing to the boil.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nSprinkle the rice around the pork belly, pushing it underneath the stock. Let the stock come to the boil again, season well, then transfer to the oven (leave it uncovered). Cook for 20 mins without stirring, then check to see how the rice is doing. The rice should be tender and the stock absorbed. If itтАЩs not ready, put back in the oven for another 5 mins, then check again. Taste for seasoning.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nSqueeze lemon juice over the top and drizzle over some extra virgin olive oil just before serving, if you like.	8	\N	Spanish	["ужин"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/arroz-al-horno-baked-rice	mealdb:53156	[{"id": "69bdbc39-8cab-4661-af1a-6882fffa4f7f", "name": "Оливковое масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 30, "amount": 30, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "30 г"}, {"id": "5c033ff7-f543-4363-a3a5-609bd95e723c", "name": "Сальтисон / грудинка", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "47ca70a9-f7b3-41ae-b9ed-93182087090f", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "6ccc6d7e-14d9-4721-93dd-f8ad603b1f3a", "name": "Чёрная кровянка", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "b5ed20b8-2b2e-447e-a4de-e11aea86dc97", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "bc079460-f087-4684-9a70-1a0ffbeb6b31", "name": "Бекон", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "ef1d7f34-d582-48bc-823e-88538f2e6ff8", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "ca53f314-cf33-4b04-883a-d099e8e3c4a5", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "c2238b09-a8fb-4081-9db9-0750a1380f95", "name": "Красный перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "8f4685b1-4b0f-407f-a77e-e4b3205c8ca6", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "aa7c4eaf-fc55-40a1-8092-cf9d87e0171f", "name": "Помидоры", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "bc4a66b0-d48d-44a1-95d6-9f56ec7e064d", "origina