oil as you need it.\r\n\r\nOnce all the vegetables are seared and removed from the pan, add the wine along with the sugar, herbs, a teaspoon of salt and a good grind of black pepper. Boil on a high heat for about three minutes.\r\n\r\nTip the lamb, vegetables and whole wheat back into the pot, and add the stock. Cover and boil for five minutes, then transfer to the oven for an hour and a half.\r\n\r\nRemove the stew from the oven and check the liquid; if there is a lot, remove the lid and boil for a few minutes.	7	\N	Irish	["ужин"]	t	http://www.ottolenghi.co.uk/recipes/meat/irish-stew-shop	mealdb:52781	[{"id": "c22937f4-35b9-49cc-b635-e1fd622a05f7", "name": "Цельнозерновая пшеничная мука", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "47c24e4d-99cb-411f-9895-e5e8e61f684b", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "75129893-41e5-4f3f-8c0a-c5e479cddcc8", "name": "Баранина (корейка)", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "6bd9e7fc-dd46-497a-9734-3be9833207d3", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "1bb8b84f-5c28-4e00-a505-a2ca603bba69", "name": "Оливковое масло", "unit": "мл", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "50 мл"}, {"id": "fe9e993b-b89d-499d-8520-75370c39e270", "name": "Шалот", "unit": "г", "grams": 1200, "amount": 1200, "ingredientId": "96e7459f-b4cf-4269-a5d5-8083754fb5f4", "originalString": "1200 г"}, {"id": "4bcad351-b2d7-4e56-9f4f-03f5f536d451", "name": "Морковь", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "3ab14c63-202a-4334-b30c-9674ce7ef8fd", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "417454a0-bf6e-4783-a718-bd15f292ca70", "name": "Репа", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "0720375b-c40b-4fea-9ab4-3fcc1464f525", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "38340411-9195-480a-9ed8-150e3777157a", "name": "Сельдерей", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "a4b7203e-cf47-4297-8829-4be3c7270d19", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "4553c4