raping the bottom. Stir in the pulped tomatoes, bring to the boil, then add the meatballs and the clams. Cover and cook for 5 mins until the clam shells open. Discard any that stay shut. Sprinkle with the chopped parsley, drizzle with the extra virgin oil, then serve with crusty bread.	4	\N	Spanish	["ужин"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/spanish-meatballs-clams-chorizo-squid	mealdb:53183	[{"id": "3ce39a88-bd8e-4766-8d29-139cc2e6504e", "name": "Масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "bd52b31b-956c-4895-9b12-39754b8c7eb3", "name": "Шалот", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "96e7459f-b4cf-4269-a5d5-8083754fb5f4", "originalString": "150 г"}, {"id": "deba0043-60d3-4983-b2b4-8410d62ba672", "name": "Копчёная паприка", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "c5390c1c-eca3-401b-a5dd-5b8aa646a882", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "230c4e27-1bf8-44a4-b077-62d8c5b611c4", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "150 г"}, {"id": "f0d33046-a13b-4b6b-a674-38ef9a85c096", "name": "Сухое херес", "unit": "мл", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "22b40ede-d775-48f3-8a07-8b13c852b7b2", "originalString": "100 мл"}, {"id": "3292fd41-0e0b-46a6-97fa-fbc49cf5f8d6", "name": "Панировочные сухари", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "e63f09a5-d79c-4418-b16d-48ff3f8ad5e5", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "ee762555-7426-4191-9891-f0d4257b2881", "name": "Свинина", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4aeae1ae-8a32-41ea-af48-7828e4bd26a6", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "00055aa1-6f3f-499d-be88-928e2ffe4d8f", "name": "Яичные желтки", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "c5c468c1-d5d7-425e-9275-de6ea68f6e67", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "ff3825cf-2d85-4271-84e7-9e39a8204de1", "name": 