 chicken is almost cooked through. This would take about 15 minutes. Slowly saut├йing the chicken will enhance the flavor, so do not expedite this step by putting it on high heat.\r\nWhen the oil separates from the spices, add the beaten yogurt keeping the heat on lowest so that the yogurt doesnтАЩt split. Sprinkle the remaining coriander seeds and add half of the dried fenugreek leaves. Mix well.\r\nFinally add the cream and give a final mix to combine everything well.\r\nSprinkle the remaining kasuri methi and garam masala and serve the chicken handi hot with naan or rotis. Enjoy!	8	\N	India	["ужин"]	t	\N	mealdb:52795	[{"id": "3253945b-64a9-4db4-99a7-d57e282c7b6b", "name": "Курица", "unit": "г", "grams": 1200, "amount": 1200, "ingredientId": "fde4920d-1aea-40db-ab56-10941a2d8d85", "originalString": "1200 г"}, {"id": "6a1172b5-1315-410b-8857-fadb0d5a6ee3", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 250, "amount": 250, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "250 г"}, {"id": "4430595e-2238-41e8-925a-08ec2948703e", "name": "Помидоры", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "bc4a66b0-d48d-44a1-95d6-9f56ec7e064d", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "af82d8eb-0aef-450d-a12f-f1fbcdf049d8", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 400, "amount": 400, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "400 г"}, {"id": "9a0fa275-3387-4b51-9cce-274022d22543", "name": "Имбирная паста", "unit": "г", "grams": 15, "amount": 15, "ingredientId": "ed7f8138-1390-4b86-9c8c-8dce5c7d815e", "originalString": "15 г"}, {"id": "036cd438-c4a1-4799-b58b-c90851771a3a", "name": "Растительное масло", "unit": "мл", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "f31757af-f603-41e1-ab30-25997e3cdada", "originalString": "50 мл"}, {"id": "bc72456f-042d-4541-aa7e-148305b69383", "name": "Семена тмина", "unit": "г", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "ef112278-e6b8-402f-b6f6-bb33f62421b1", "originalString": "10 г"}, {"id": "3662a