 sugar, and white pepper. Toss until combined and the sugar and bouillon have dissolved, about 1 minute.\r\n\r\nAdd eggs, stir-fry, and garnish:\r\nAdd the eggs back to the pan with the tomatoes. Stir-fry for about 2 minutes to heat through and combine. Taste, adding salt only if needed. Sprinkle with the green onions and serve with steamed rice.on of water, plus salt to taste.	5	\N	Chinese	["ужин"]	t	https://www.simplyrecipes.com/chinese-tomato-egg-recipe-7562056	mealdb:53372	[{"id": "58e81281-457b-4837-9fda-8baf9a092c75", "name": "Сливовые помидоры", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "5344580f-bd38-4b6d-9ace-f708638529cd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "49f7781b-5fb7-4458-a6fc-53e2ac58a7be", "name": "Растительное масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 15, "amount": 15, "ingredientId": "f31757af-f603-41e1-ab30-25997e3cdada", "originalString": "15 г"}, {"id": "e367b7a0-2ea3-4519-8eac-34b6a2beef28", "name": "Яйца", "unit": "г", "grams": 250, "amount": 250, "ingredientId": "2fc401b0-e772-47dd-bd82-3638f892a36d", "originalString": "250 г"}, {"id": "aec3805e-3b12-442a-996b-856badbd5dd7", "name": "Кунжутное масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "b9cc0a95-6c86-4934-8f21-aa79d1153073", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "9d88e89f-64f2-4eeb-b6f9-14d57b7bd9fe", "name": "Куриный бульонный порошок", "unit": "г", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "1d224b9a-98d5-4113-bff8-1076c13ab60b", "originalString": "10 г"}, {"id": "761be87c-36dd-4f72-aea3-cfcf390e459a", "name": "Сахар", "unit": "г", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "f686d932-ccf2-4d50-9f23-2e0375fdd9d4", "originalString": "10 г"}, {"id": "196dc5c9-d764-40c7-b9fc-6ecd5ecd7342", "name": "Перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 2.5, "amount": 2.5, "ingredientId": "01a35a87-6c12-4f1b-87cf-323571bc15cd", "originalString": "2.5 г"}, {"id": "166a1b0a-e791-4c19-9252-247bd0113dd7", "name": "Соль", "unit": "г", "grams": 1.3, "amount": 1.3, "ingredientId": "3789cffa-31e4-49d0-bca4-aded4