 - STIR FRY\r\nAdd the sauce to the wok and then the broccoli and wait until it is boiling.\r\nTo thicken the sauce, whisk together 2 Tablespoon of cornstarch and 4 Tablespoon of water in a bowl and slowly add to your stir-fry until it's the right thickness.\r\nNext add in the chicken and stir-fry for a minute and serve on a plate	5	\N	Chinese	["ужин"]	t	https://www.skinnytaste.com/general-tsos-chicken/	mealdb:52951	[{"id": "3b1e13d7-11ab-4d06-99d8-fec3c52fa29d", "name": "Куриная грудка", "unit": "г", "grams": 75, "amount": 75, "ingredientId": "12c12878-ea46-4858-9358-8795cf84fcbb", "originalString": "75 г"}, {"id": "8e51c8f4-f176-4cb5-a5a1-6255885792d8", "name": "Пшеничная мука", "unit": "г", "grams": 180, "amount": 180, "ingredientId": "89fd83a9-9424-4975-a81b-218d640c70a2", "originalString": "180 г"}, {"id": "870817ae-4c33-4c37-b569-5e4550b3e17d", "name": "Яйцо", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "cab42edd-5e3a-4893-839e-9f4ef50c6cf0", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "2bdf738c-7fbd-44df-aae6-74b571d7556a", "name": "Крахмал", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "5bdee241-6014-4beb-860d-bffae26ac020", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "67ef1985-3b40-4404-a8ef-ebcfcd5ef31f", "name": "Разрыхлитель", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "972b3e3a-16f2-4ec2-b5e3-2bd543cca16d", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "0d282cfd-a52b-48e6-ab6f-347378d83c5f", "name": "Соль", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "3789cffa-31e4-49d0-bca4-aded4002f42c", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "b0366310-c8cc-4d14-8cc2-afbb56cce2b4", "name": "Лук соль", "unit": "г", "grams": 2.5, "amount": 2.5, "ingredientId": "e5d3c531-b8c8-4079-93e7-dc91789897ec", "originalString": "2.5 г"}, {"id": "0e061ddf-eec3-44a7-bef0-e5a1774da6e4", "name": "Чесночный порошок", "unit": "г", "grams": 1.3, "amount": 1.3, "ingredientId": "84004af3-a81c-4b36-8253-ec8d9bd333cd", "originalString": "1.3 г"}, {"id": "92317bc0-a691-4bcc-bc00-2c