n and heat the grill. Scatter the top with the remaining herbs and breadcrumbs, drizzle a little oil over the top, and return to the oven for 5-10 mins, until the breadcrumbs are golden. Serve with crusty bread and green veg.	4	\N	France	["ужин"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/jacks-pork-cassoulet	mealdb:52847	[{"id": "c695bcf5-d3ab-49da-b009-b52ea2cbbbe3", "name": "Сало гусиное", "unit": "г", "grams": 60, "amount": 60, "ingredientId": "a39c1018-b6c7-477b-9c16-07b0101abb75", "originalString": "60 г"}, {"id": "51286f34-9a81-41e6-9cf7-e66522ebc298", "name": "Свинина", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4aeae1ae-8a32-41ea-af48-7828e4bd26a6", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "8475acc2-59be-401c-a95e-a27ae784ecd8", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "f2ddc7bb-e791-4fb1-a6a6-7fc58b481c7c", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 500, "amount": 500, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "500 г"}, {"id": "fefbeb3f-4b4a-46f0-948a-5d67d678beb8", "name": "Морковь", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "3ab14c63-202a-4334-b30c-9674ce7ef8fd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "e4b5467c-36f2-4152-9a36-b1bf33ed8309", "name": "Семена фенхеля", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "c50d8276-6c7c-4f6d-859e-f59afd8818bd", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "49eb4cfb-6c45-43b6-a1e3-85a38a69ff11", "name": "Красный винный уксус", "unit": "мл", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "e8014bf4-6569-4033-a132-ad1af08ee1d3", "originalString": "100 мл"}, {"id": "74b9f054-723e-4588-88b8-37d5e74253df", "name": "Овощной бульон", "unit": "мл", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "bff11d6b-d845-4500-9af2-b6760a6e6843", "originalString": "50 мл"}, {"id": "8340b759-9dd4-4691-9397-07fd76e0a2c5", "name": "Томатное пюре", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "25b50