 the ragu sauce into the bottom of the roasting tin or casserole dish, spreading the sauce all over the base. Place 2 sheets of lasagne on top of the sauce overlapping to make it fit, then repeat with more sauce and another layer of pasta. Repeat with a further 2 layers of sauce and pasta, finishing with a layer of pasta.\r\nPut the cr├иme fra├оche in a bowl and mix with 2 tbsp water to loosen it and make a smooth pourable sauce. Pour this over the top of the pasta, then top with the mozzarella. Sprinkle Parmesan over the top and bake for 25тАУ30 mins until golden and bubbling. Serve scattered with basil, if you like.	3	\N	Italian	["ужин"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/classic-lasagne	mealdb:52844	[{"id": "a625f471-bcfd-4ed9-9059-7dd2ab5a2e2f", "name": "Оливковое масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "4ded3576-a620-4f10-94b1-4c1bfede95b1", "name": "Бекон", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "ef1d7f34-d582-48bc-823e-88538f2e6ff8", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "6af1f436-2468-4094-b40c-94a79ac590d0", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "b5323450-0a7f-4a96-b4de-7809ccc12f39", "name": "Сельдерей", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "a4b7203e-cf47-4297-8829-4be3c7270d19", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "491797bc-761f-47f6-a5c8-90adaf479457", "name": "Морковь", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "3ab14c63-202a-4334-b30c-9674ce7ef8fd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "46f5210f-82d4-431e-9425-32acf8843f93", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "93b551f8-429a-4826-9a16-291057d57232", "name": "Говяжий фарш", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "15229283-665a