til ready to serve.\r\n\r\n2.\r\nFor the Eggplant: While lentils cook, cut each eggplant in half. Score flesh with the tip of a paring knife in a cross-hatch pattern at 1-inch intervals. Transfer to a foil-lined rimmed baking sheet, cut side up, and brush each eggplant half with 1 tablespoon oil, letting each brushstroke be fully absorbed before brushing with more. Season with salt and pepper. Place a rosemary sprig on top of each one. Transfer to oven and roast until completely tender and well charred, 25 to 35 minutes. Remove from oven and discard rosemary.\r\n\r\n3.\r\nTo Serve: Heat 2 tablespoons olive oil and pine nuts in a medium skillet set over medium heat. Cook, tossing nuts frequently, until golden brown and aromatic, about 4 minutes. Transfer to a bowl to halt cooking. Stir half of parsley and rosemary into lentils and transfer to a serving platter. Arrange eggplant halves on top. Spread a few tablespoons of tahini sauce over each eggplant half and sprinkle with pine nuts. Sprinkle with remaining parsley and rosemary, drizzle with additional olive oil, and serve.	4	\N	United States	["ужин"]	t	http://www.seriouseats.com/recipes/2016/03/roasted-eggplant-tahini-pine-nut-lentil-vegan-experience-recipe.html	mealdb:52816	[{"id": "b085a134-218f-40df-a991-2b9dd7e20e66", "name": "Оливковое масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 30, "amount": 30, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "30 г"}, {"id": "2207406b-b888-4a25-a015-d7c24ac75b8e", "name": "Морковь", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "3ab14c63-202a-4334-b30c-9674ce7ef8fd", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "628149d8-6feb-48fe-a05d-d1a60aee1728", "name": "Сельдерей", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "a4b7203e-cf47-4297-8829-4be3c7270d19", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "0721914e-fbe7-4d62-9edb-8ab0373ab65a", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalStr