/180C fan/gas 6. Using a piping bag or plastic food bag with the corner snipped off, squeeze the filling into the cannelloni tubes. Lay the tubes, side by side, on top of the tomato sauce and spoon over the mascarpone sauce. Top with Parmesan and mozzarella. You can now freeze the cannelloni, uncooked, or you can cook it first and then freeze. Bake for 30-35 mins until golden and bubbling. Remove from oven and let stand for 5 mins before serving.	4	\N	Italian	["ужин"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/531632/spinach-and-ricotta-cannelloni	mealdb:52849	[{"id": "bcb9e45f-ccdc-428c-8732-d1887e9d2d9e", "name": "Оливковое масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 45, "amount": 45, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "45 г"}, {"id": "ea6d5ab1-d5a5-4cdd-93f0-533054d2ecd4", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 400, "amount": 400, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "400 г"}, {"id": "ab130c74-139d-4177-878a-89bb8c99fafd", "name": "Сахарная пудра", "unit": "г", "grams": 45, "amount": 45, "ingredientId": "0ae3eca4-e36e-42f4-ae8e-a3f42bcb8501", "originalString": "45 г"}, {"id": "31ec0d50-1845-4c2a-bab7-e6e3f81f0b18", "name": "Винный уксус красный", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "e2be8d4a-9f08-45c9-aa55-904afaf1094b", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "92ab3385-c79c-4e02-92bf-08b2b6b1457c", "name": "Томаты нарезанные", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "6bb88833-e4c2-4c34-aa82-b8d7869be930", "originalString": "150 г"}, {"id": "51319ac9-d663-4d98-8571-6987b49caf5f", "name": "Листья базилика", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "a8fadb8b-a268-4467-ae6e-9e75559687a8", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "e647fd13-63b2-456a-96b0-d96f187399d0", "name": "Маскарпоне", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "976fa240-e554-42ae-86b8-73cbfaa3d7d7", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "4e49ed7f-f8b7-4693-9cad-21462372114a", "name":