aragus on the bread. Drizzle with horseradish cream, then sprinkle grated cheese over the top. Garnish with the crispy shallots and some fresh dill to finish.	3	\N	Norway	["ужин"]	t	https://www.bbc.co.uk/food/recipes/nordic_smorrebrod_69435	mealdb:53117	[{"id": "a66d7e8f-7eca-48ec-984d-43ad61e5ff27", "name": "Сметана", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4444a8fe-2206-4e3b-bba5-e239526acdda", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "f73cc8ac-f098-43a4-9882-6de64c4a6888", "name": "Хрен", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "d48b78f7-5844-4208-ac6a-7062307efed0", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "eb66d5c0-12e5-490e-ae5b-d7fbef4ad48e", "name": "Лимонный сок", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "3779e3c1-9b78-4f1e-b93b-0c38baafe431", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "e2814b52-50c0-4da3-ab16-d85c58496e99", "name": "Соль", "unit": "г", "grams": 1.5, "amount": 1.5, "ingredientId": "3789cffa-31e4-49d0-bca4-aded4002f42c", "originalString": "1.5 г"}, {"id": "7fddc4f3-f5eb-414f-9e98-2fc4ac73fd42", "name": "Перец чёрный", "unit": "г", "grams": 1, "amount": 1, "ingredientId": "ae6bf047-0402-4110-8255-31a19012263b", "originalString": "1 г"}, {"id": "b68b5321-bc09-4671-87d6-2934c3c95133", "name": "Растительное масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "f31757af-f603-41e1-ab30-25997e3cdada", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "998cd8c2-b25b-4332-a8e7-eb0dc25f641a", "name": "Шалот", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "96e7459f-b4cf-4269-a5d5-8083754fb5f4", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "e7f9b48d-ab82-4802-8dd0-d0ee2fc0797a", "name": "Белая спаржа", "unit": "г", "grams": 400, "amount": 400, "ingredientId": "f0432036-6b6c-4e8e-8740-d4430b44e2a9", "originalString": "400 г"}, {"id": "004d7aad-0dbc-4550-8870-766a7afbbb11", "name": "Ржаной хлеб", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "de4c9cb6-f17c-4f3f-b120-3f079ae2736c", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "a07e8