he cheese to soften it, then beat in the milk to make a spreadable consistency. Stir in the herbs, salt and pepper. Line a deep, 20-23cm round cake tin with cling film (use a tin the same size as the frying pan). Select the best red pepper omelette and place in the tin, prettiest side down. Spread with a thin layer of cheese filling, then cover with a courgette omelette. Repeat, alternating the layers, until all the omelettes and filling are in the tin, finishing with an omelette. Flip the cling film over the omelette, then chill for up to 24 hrs.\r\nTo serve, invert the omelette cake onto a serving plate and peel off the cling film. Pile rocket on the top and scatter over the cheese, a drizzle of olive oil and a little freshly ground black pepper. Serve cut into wedges.	4	\N	France	["ужин"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/6428/provenal-omelette-cake	mealdb:52921	[{"id": "4534bf60-84b0-49ba-8fb0-c3e14674d934", "name": "Яйца", "unit": "шт", "grams": 220, "amount": 4, "ingredientId": "2fc401b0-e772-47dd-bd82-3638f892a36d", "originalString": "4 шт"}, {"id": "0c51059b-2146-4573-a45a-5e1ae6d21fb7", "name": "Оливковое масло", "unit": "мл", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "50 мл"}, {"id": "055eba21-432c-4ab7-8ba9-b18e60a3d73f", "name": "Цукини", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "1ef22ac1-6d20-4418-a66e-51ab1fc31a03", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "28f210c2-6300-4d68-9883-08eb635692ce", "name": "Зелёный лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "e15bcbde-b1b4-4df4-a673-98865ea67f17", "originalString": "150 г"}, {"id": "1a0b8ff9-f602-4b20-a5fd-46bdf7732536", "name": "Красный перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "8f4685b1-4b0f-407f-a77e-e4b3205c8ca6", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "c87e956d-95fb-469d-af4f-1020a00401b7", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-