leave to simmer until ready to serve.\r\nWhen youтАЩre almost ready to eat, heat about 1cm/┬╜in vegetable oil in a frying pan and heat until just smoking.\r\nShape the dumpling mix into plum-size balls and shallow-fry until golden-brown. (CAUTION: hot oil can be dangerous. Do not leave the pan unattended.)\r\nDrain the dumplings on kitchen paper and serve with the saltfish and ackee.	2	\N	Jamaican	["ужин"]	t	https://www.bbc.co.uk/food/recipes/saltfish__ackee_with_64803	mealdb:52936	[{"id": "eb3e0d61-a9bd-4d8d-9124-136f36f7446e", "name": "Соль трески", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "bf53bfca-20ad-4dd1-97e5-6e5675f21f49", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "135f8056-68c6-4513-b1dc-e9961d5ec7ba", "name": "Акки", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "6d1792d2-33e5-4564-9612-39038ef9da45", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "67fa6690-af26-4415-9aab-8e5c7ee7cbf8", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "cddb2461-8e11-4fbf-bd40-bf4958c8c5da", "name": "Паприка", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "85045806-3a18-4d35-ad01-0230c0cb98d2", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "e8f41455-7e0e-4762-b2f9-6c7e33463c3e", "name": "Кари-порошок", "unit": "г", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "ec9eef44-d11f-40e8-bac8-2397d28e7ecf", "originalString": "10 г"}, {"id": "00d2a8a0-d87b-4219-93ab-3ad81883d4aa", "name": "Топинамбур", "unit": "г", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "ffce4339-2210-4298-acec-94bc23bc99e2", "originalString": "10 г"}, {"id": "dff4f6cf-9642-4dcd-b285-0a298a32a0b6", "name": "Острая соус", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "85a99a51-849c-435a-96a8-38a11c49422f", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "3d60d82f-2b75-49ba-b2aa-cee2476f11c3", "name": "Красный перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "8f4685b1-4b0f-407f-a77e-e4b3205c8ca6", "originalString": 