rounding pastry with egg yolk. Fold the ends over, the wrap the pastry around the beef, cutting off any excess. Turn over, so the seam is underneath, and place on a baking sheet. Brush over all the pastry with egg and chill for about 15 mins to let the pastry rest.\r\nHeat the oven to 200C, 400F, gas 6.\r\nLightly score the pastry at 1cm intervals and glaze again with beaten egg yolk. Bake for 20 minutes, then lower the oven setting to 180C, 350F, gas 4 and cook for another 15 mins. Allow to rest for 10-15 mins before slicing and serving with the side dishes of your choice. The beef should still be pink in the centre when you serve it.	2	\N	British	["ужин"]	t	http://www.goodtoknow.co.uk/recipes/164868/Gordon-Ramsay-s-beef-Wellington	mealdb:52803	[{"id": "bc800f06-7fa3-4486-95f6-a908c86b71f6", "name": "Говядина филе", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "3b34db77-4907-4579-87b5-b6dfbaba1149", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "ad0fe796-7418-44e0-9136-229c2b5af8c7", "name": "Пармская ветчина", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "24e1354a-ea35-4710-a8b0-672215f82a67", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "de38a6b0-2831-4b64-b607-bb97ff17050e", "name": "Грибы", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "97f04ffa-f6a9-4e22-b285-58e2a13b33b0", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "1027656f-7543-40a1-abe3-396dddb83480", "name": "Английская горчица", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "594b2b5e-f9e5-4cb2-85b5-e1a5bcf43807", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "367d35e8-3c27-48f6-b7b2-37432354c2cc", "name": "Оливковое масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "b90453ce-9f24-471e-9606-8d1ccfba9f13", "name": "Слоёное тесто", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4ccd5ab0-8da3-414a-9cb0-b6cc27e05f73", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "c885dd0b-1646-49da-9ceb-b6544c3684fc", "name": "Мука", "unit": 