 through and sauce is thickened, about 4 minutes. Transfer steak to serving plates and stir parsley and chives into sauce; pour sauce over steaks to serve.	4	\N	France	["ужин"]	t	https://www.saveur.com/article/Recipes/Classic-Steak-Diane	mealdb:52935	[{"id": "e19a16f2-95da-4131-bf0c-c7bc89667e68", "name": "Масло канолы", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "ebaee842-27b5-4501-96a4-6b6da82b88e7", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "c5e1e7b2-cb46-458f-a935-7113e95c4b40", "name": "Говяжий филе", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "4ac64930-7105-4150-a14f-737a3243bf7d", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "89480282-158f-416b-b2db-4ce86f260b37", "name": "Говяжий бульон", "unit": "г", "grams": 360, "amount": 360, "ingredientId": "e4abe98d-da0e-4159-8aed-2ce633951fc1", "originalString": "360 г"}, {"id": "2191b239-9dcb-4f8a-90ac-19edb9b6549c", "name": "Масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "56bee97c-03b5-4095-ae77-d64608681ff7", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "a67eab11-a7f9-432c-bb7f-1a05b031caa9", "name": "Шалот", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "96e7459f-b4cf-4269-a5d5-8083754fb5f4", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "d80c1661-6b30-4880-bf2a-23457d9d4501", "name": "Грибы", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "97f04ffa-f6a9-4e22-b285-58e2a13b33b0", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "348d3e25-741f-46f8-8632-5b1bc8f72bbb", "name": "Когтей", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "fcc70f51-912e-4d5f-a146-80e85abf3ae2", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "818690ea-94c3-4d91-aef0-b67527ecac3e", "name": "Жирные сливки", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "cb75f090-b8e7-41df-bce1-4affc4d30842", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "36138a