 frying pan. Tip 2 tbsp sesame seeds onto a plate. Rub 1 tsp oil into 4 x 175g sirloin steaks and press into sesame seeds. Fry for 5 mins for medium rare, turning halfway. Leave to rest for 5 mins, then thinly slice. Toss 1 deseeded and shredded red chilli, and a handful mint leaves into noodles. Top with steak to serve.	4	\N	Thai	["ужин"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/thai-rice-noodle-salad	mealdb:53203	[{"id": "b56e8e18-1396-4909-b1da-fc487f659374", "name": "Рисовая лапша вермишель", "unit": "г", "grams": 25, "amount": 25, "ingredientId": "d748ae92-46ef-4257-81f4-c8df49b45b70", "originalString": "25 г"}, {"id": "6f350272-abd9-4d61-a6ce-23d820f44906", "name": "Ростки фасоли", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "510b3d5b-a45a-4396-98c0-e8f1459a778b", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "0be57424-2d5c-4d6f-b0e9-c717cf0c00bb", "name": "Лайм", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "d69a6d78-fb1a-455e-8c7a-0fb3887dfa17", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "79171c8f-f3c6-421e-9e06-4771acfa6876", "name": "Рыбный соус", "unit": "мл", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "91b70c2e-68d5-4936-81d3-a0eb5c94aec9", "originalString": "50 мл"}, {"id": "8eea8d90-eb81-4af8-bdff-6ab4f895cd67", "name": "Сахар мусковадо", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "a0c7e794-985b-4adc-b7f8-f8eb27b753eb", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "7d781605-0e4a-494a-9eaf-430144c55d96", "name": "Красный лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "e90c3874-7702-443d-a509-8a57053c11cc", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "86cfcca7-f26f-4061-95fd-a8904d6bdba2", "name": "Салат", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "885a38d0-1b1a-41d9-8980-32d77042feff", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "2716c6b6-e584-4935-aea6-e90680c81fcf", "name": "Фарш свинины", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "6b35780e-68d9-44b7-af53-20ceaef8c4e0", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "0eb5c5e8-8c1e-440c-bd05