em briefly on the heat or they will quickly lose their brightness. Scatter with the lime garnish and serve immediately with boiled rice.	3	\N	Thai	["ужин"]	t	http://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/3235/thai-green-chicken-curry	mealdb:52814	[{"id": "a1c5747b-22c7-4fc3-8532-02b2e29f5e43", "name": "Картофель", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "99928917-5708-4040-aefa-1a6d06d27937", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "e525b97a-3bf7-40f3-8fcd-bed97fdd965f", "name": "Стручковая фасоль", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "2bc6a16c-84d4-4e39-afaf-85de693e2a64", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "5c46a60a-fb31-4977-8b63-602dcbac762c", "name": "Подсолнечное масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 15, "amount": 15, "ingredientId": "9c0157c3-cccb-4325-8c3d-5214e3e6b67a", "originalString": "15 г"}, {"id": "d68b0612-5712-402f-8269-9335f54c7671", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "3ba5f70f-e2be-491d-b4a7-d3ac17ac8dd7", "name": "Тайская зелёная карри-паста", "unit": "г", "grams": 20, "amount": 20, "ingredientId": "81538631-aa66-4f20-b740-dee6391d37f4", "originalString": "20 г"}, {"id": "1af1ad5c-4592-48a2-9cfb-8a3e7e2283f9", "name": "Кокосовое молоко", "unit": "мл", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "5b412dd6-93d5-4ab2-92c1-3700bee8c60f", "originalString": "50 мл"}, {"id": "1c5d7868-a596-4497-a99c-67d71a892230", "name": "Рыбный соус", "unit": "г", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "91b70c2e-68d5-4936-81d3-a0eb5c94aec9", "originalString": "10 г"}, {"id": "07d7e82c-2cb9-478f-90eb-3cf3e7fe420e", "name": "Сахар", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "f686d932-ccf2-4d50-9f23-2e0375fdd9d4", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "c9af84a6-8aa7-4500-a501-5a2ccae51fba", "name": "Курица", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "fde4920d-1aea-40db-ab56-10941a2d8d85", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "b2f