lly stuff each pepper half with the quinoa and black bean mixture. Top the stuffed peppers with the remaining 1/2 cup of shredded cheese, if using.\r\n6. Return the stuffed peppers to the oven, and bake for another 15-20 minutes, until the cheese is melted and the peppers are tender.\r\n7. Remove from the oven, and allow the stuffed peppers to cool for 5 minutes before serving. Garnish with fresh chopped cilantro.	4	\N	Mexican	["ужин"]	t	\N	mealdb:53067	[{"id": "e195d076-f23e-4068-b75d-ae48911447e3", "name": "Болгарский перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "14cb1e93-5492-4598-93fc-6f9f5c679725", "originalString": "150 г"}, {"id": "41192dfa-3c29-4c02-89ce-a0ed94759560", "name": "Оливковое масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 15, "amount": 15, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "15 г"}, {"id": "01195954-dc2c-4357-bcb0-ab18050e03d2", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "1f29d55b-093d-4cb7-8197-9d16f0557b5a", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "20a8ec20-11c8-4548-9f01-83575641810a", "name": "Киноа", "unit": "г", "grams": 240, "amount": 240, "ingredientId": "1a91c05a-9497-4d25-8dad-853a1d632708", "originalString": "240 г"}, {"id": "e5e51083-48f1-409e-9efc-5329bfce504c", "name": "Чёрная фасоль", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "524c7bb4-00ff-4e1d-a64a-ab6f9aca3dc6", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "c7d79155-94d9-4e7c-8b06-49aa3f58db26", "name": "Кукуруза", "unit": "г", "grams": 240, "amount": 240, "ingredientId": "60741f9d-3102-47b9-bde8-072a9ff2fab2", "originalString": "240 г"}, {"id": "75530376-ed08-4a3e-bec1-e0d20c7cf973", "name": "Помидоры в кубиках", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "46ce439b-1c3d-4727-93e9-5c53e761cf69", "originalString"