s of the tin.\r\nTransfer the tart, with the tin base attached, to a serving plate. Serve warm with cream, cr├иme fraiche or ice cream.	2	\N	British	["перекус"]	t	https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rp8Slv4INLk	mealdb:52768	[{"id": "e58da2d6-f3d2-47e7-b66e-66f1bd92f20b", "name": "Песочное печенье", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "e250f389-decf-475e-8199-db93b221613f", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "c04a9e70-896f-4f79-842b-2f5d7b75f54b", "name": "Масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "ed82a15f-17cc-4232-acfa-9d6e2906c09c", "name": "Яблоки брамли", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "c3c54e9e-a2cd-414d-be52-f9ef622ac6e2", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "8a6ee83a-89c3-43e3-b29c-7513288ba357", "name": "Соленое масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "2c2b5fab-97df-451d-89b2-c0c725035a54", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "c4e97b38-3991-4bbe-98b1-d8a4274d278a", "name": "Сахарная пудра", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "0ae3eca4-e36e-42f4-ae8e-a3f42bcb8501", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "968365da-e4a2-4963-a9be-6e401df0c474", "name": "Яйца", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "2fc401b0-e772-47dd-bd82-3638f892a36d", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "819ee03a-9755-4117-8c23-8c8994a0b676", "name": "Молотые миндаль", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4bb4a2d7-98b0-4236-b7c7-3b3f64286c92", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "4e968e8d-50cb-4291-9662-f6eaf932ac2e", "name": "Миндальный экстракт", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "80025ce0-0cac-4733-ae53-a540bd61a990", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "0b9ce29f-7e7c-4236-aea5-0ff1f98354c7", "name": "Лопнувшие миндаль", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "55338047-3840-484b-b5fa-c1c6a323ce6b", "originalString": "50 г"}]	["vegetarian", "lactose-f