ther in neat circles on the top of the cake. Bake in the oven for 45 mins.\r\nLower the oven temperature to 160C/140 C fan/Gas Mark 3 and cook for a further 60тАУ80 minutes. Check the cake after 50 minutes by inserting a wooden or metal skewer into the cake. When itтАЩs done it should have just a few crumbs attached. Check every 10 minutes - itтАЩs important not to overcook this cake so the centre will be a little soft.\r\nWhen cooked, remove the cake briefly from the oven, put the milk and sugar into a small pan and heat gently until the sugar has dissolved. Brush over the top of the cake and return the cake to the oven for 2-3 mins. Remove and allow the cake to cool in the tin. When quite cold remove from the tin and wrap in foil and keep for at least 2 days before cutting.	3	\N	British	["перекус"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/2155640/dundee-cake	mealdb:52899	[{"id": "66e19e53-9de5-4773-ba38-2f0f6b819d85", "name": "Миндаль", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "e2d86884-2548-43b1-90cc-fc741c8f32ca", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "5315e21b-564d-449b-bec7-adc1f1c846d1", "name": "Масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "5279a85d-bec3-4e93-b1be-bec1beeef09d", "name": "Сахар мусковадо", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "a0c7e794-985b-4adc-b7f8-f8eb27b753eb", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "8b0f3e17-0e0b-42ca-89a0-c33fa2d962ca", "name": "Апельсин", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "db449f2a-d8b0-4a8e-b4fa-0e922c71ce75", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "386605ac-b051-49df-ae38-07d608f36a74", "name": "Абрикосовое варенье", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "0c9bfb2d-48b9-487e-9091-b8d7c46e33a9", "originalString": "150 г"}, {"id": "ae1f6c92-054c-46b3-9e85-f4cd1da69981", "name": "Пшеничная мука", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "89fd83a9-9424-4975-