ooled cake in half horizontally using a serrated knife, so you have two layers. Put the bottom layer on a plate or cake stand and spread over a generous spoonful of the pistachio cream. Top with a generous handful of the raspberries so the cake is covered. Top with the other sponge half, then cover the top and sides of the cake with the remaining cream. Scatter over the last of the raspberries, the remaining pistachios and the lime zest to serve. Will keep chilled in an airtight container for two days.	3	\N	Polish	["перекус"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/pistachio-cake	mealdb:53293	[{"id": "ddd536ad-0958-4644-97e0-537802f7c483", "name": "Масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "14003f94-1553-4ed2-beb8-5140527f0391", "name": "Фисташки", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "2e424ae7-25e2-40c2-8a67-e81fd424464d", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "ec526825-8a61-4883-af37-01addc7e36fb", "name": "Пшеничная мука", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "89fd83a9-9424-4975-a81b-218d640c70a2", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "bee64c3f-d609-46e2-88b9-59a05f79535b", "name": "Разрыхлитель", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "972b3e3a-16f2-4ec2-b5e3-2bd543cca16d", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "19f0122f-a84a-4941-a62f-5bac555a7f38", "name": "Сахарная пудра", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "0ae3eca4-e36e-42f4-ae8e-a3f42bcb8501", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "7648849f-7577-4a84-a0fe-ceb2799676d9", "name": "Яйцо", "unit": "шт", "grams": 110, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "cab42edd-5e3a-4893-839e-9f4ef50c6cf0", "originalString": "200 шт"}, {"id": "6379da22-1ff5-4565-acc7-b327d8216e66", "name": "Экстракт ванили", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "25a008ab-be69-4c8b-bfdc-080e8da43fef", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "12f20169-79a6-45a3-9ca8-6fb3cfc513a9", "name": "