ith the whole egg, egg yolks and nutmeg. Lightly beat together, then season. Stir in the leeks. Spoon ?the mixture into the tart case and bake for 35-40 minutes until set ?and lightly golden. Remove from ?the oven and leave for 10 minutes. Take out of the tin and serve.	2	\N	France	["ужин"]	t	http://www.deliciousmagazine.co.uk/recipes/flamiche-flemish-leek-tart/	mealdb:52906	[{"id": "948f1cdf-8719-4308-a30f-25dd09fab748", "name": "Масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "2bb53378-e6ba-4df8-a966-6a19da8e2b13", "name": "Лук-порей", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "7c3f95ba-19e8-40ba-bae6-641396ab35a4", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "54da3c0b-0dc4-4c5d-93fb-d3dadb8933c7", "name": "Соль", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "3789cffa-31e4-49d0-bca4-aded4002f42c", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "8291f2b4-83b1-49cc-bcd1-977d0a08fec6", "name": "Сметана", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4444a8fe-2206-4e3b-bba5-e239526acdda", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "89a76938-619f-4b36-a5a0-a8ea14247346", "name": "Яйцо", "unit": "шт", "grams": 55, "amount": 1, "ingredientId": "cab42edd-5e3a-4893-839e-9f4ef50c6cf0", "originalString": "1 шт"}, {"id": "3831a9b5-8411-4755-b222-60e0e6e63aba", "name": "Яичные желтки", "unit": "шт", "grams": 180, "amount": 3, "ingredientId": "c5c468c1-d5d7-425e-9275-de6ea68f6e67", "originalString": "3 шт"}, {"id": "cf09791b-71ef-42ad-9aaa-9e4070631adb", "name": "Мускатный орех", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "fbd011f6-270f-40bb-8cbb-68bcac3551bc", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "3c51e7be-cf57-43bd-a02e-d9e0d1524cf2", "name": "Пшеничная мука", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "89fd83a9-9424-4975-a81b-218d640c70a2", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "d80519e9-f728-4a95-a5fc-277c3b2d2342", "name": "Сыр чеддер", "unit": "г", "grams": 