lm sugar, fish sauce and soy to season. Cook the noodles according to package instructions and split between two bowls, topping each with the sliced beef. Bring the stock to the boil and then pour into the bowls (the heat will cook the beef). Top each with the spring onions, chilli slices and herbs. Serve with the lime wedges to squeeze over.	6	\N	Vietnamese	["ужин"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/beef-pho	mealdb:53238	[{"id": "0fa25c70-fe38-4290-888a-b6875b0e277e", "name": "Говяжий бульон", "unit": "г", "grams": 1000, "amount": 1000, "ingredientId": "e4abe98d-da0e-4159-8aed-2ce633951fc1", "originalString": "1000 г"}, {"id": "4da9399f-4e00-473f-9109-7d6c3b5c9507", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "851a4ac7-6c56-48e6-8178-564f583a1829", "name": "Имбирь", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "245533a8-d5cb-4feb-9254-2f888a3b4f85", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "1a20e5a6-15dd-4659-8fde-5fc683b6eb83", "name": "Корица", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "c508be3b-b158-45c7-9a46-2326abea13d0", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "fb05890e-64b4-45a5-a99e-6d1cac5c5e61", "name": "Звезда анис", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "6f9619f1-97bf-4361-9bf9-72a88d9d1f92", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "0c235d8c-4487-488a-a975-6146fcc6e368", "name": "Семена кориандра", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "94c854a8-d998-40f6-b17e-b8c50f4c632e", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "44f4f308-a4a3-490c-b97a-369b5beb927d", "name": "Гвоздика", "unit": "г", "grams": 2.5, "amount": 2.5, "ingredientId": "dfbbaba4-1f1d-40e2-949c-06b7a6a78217", "originalString": "2.5 г"}, {"id": "ecbcaebc-6c5a-490c-854e-10e30ac74504", "name": "Стейк филе", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "7d494f15-0810-44b8-83db-e6ceeb5d9bc3", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "cf0187be-3956-4322-997