rown on top. Sprinkle the reserved crumb over the top and place it into the preheated oven.\r\nBake until the meringue browns, around 10 minutes, making sure to watch it carefully.\r\nChill in the fridge and eat within a few hours of baking. This pie is best eaten the same day as the meringue will soften and liquify.	5	\N	Canadian	["перекус"]	t	https://canadianfoodfocus.org/recipes/classic-canadian-dish-flapper-pie/	mealdb:53341	[{"id": "8193af1b-bda8-4db8-b8b3-f14375a7c7e8", "name": "Крошки печенья грэм", "unit": "г", "grams": 360, "amount": 360, "ingredientId": "fdbb6e44-8fdd-478c-86a8-44f24a54c758", "originalString": "360 г"}, {"id": "f1f240b6-b7b9-41e3-8249-accf8b30db32", "name": "Масло растопленное", "unit": "г", "grams": 90, "amount": 90, "ingredientId": "40a697a8-046d-4d28-9e95-c35680612442", "originalString": "90 г"}, {"id": "4414dfce-8fd7-495e-884f-46185e0dc580", "name": "Сахар", "unit": "г", "grams": 120, "amount": 120, "ingredientId": "f686d932-ccf2-4d50-9f23-2e0375fdd9d4", "originalString": "120 г"}, {"id": "ae9c87a3-5cc1-416e-9498-af2253af7881", "name": "Молотая корица", "unit": "г", "grams": 2.5, "amount": 2.5, "ingredientId": "bd59c7c9-4302-46cc-9554-f9762887d074", "originalString": "2.5 г"}, {"id": "e8adcf5b-b199-41ee-91ac-f8c79f2fa1f2", "name": "Молоко", "unit": "мл", "grams": 600, "amount": 600, "ingredientId": "d106cc74-1977-4922-ba5e-2a79a179b0ab", "originalString": "600 мл"}, {"id": "0251bfbc-a3cf-4ac4-ab16-5b44f6e8c9d3", "name": "Кукурузный крахмал", "unit": "г", "grams": 60, "amount": 60, "ingredientId": "41137d44-eccd-4d8e-b985-ca171a3b3a50", "originalString": "60 г"}, {"id": "f450951b-d4f6-440d-8aa7-fb00f2d3bdc8", "name": "Яичные желтки", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "c5c468c1-d5d7-425e-9275-de6ea68f6e67", "originalString": "150 г"}, {"id": "4f9df015-a6e1-4aa6-bf18-88320041407e", "name": "Экстракт ванили", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "25a008ab-be69-4c8b-bfdc-080e8da43fef", "originalStrin