ce cooled, use a large serrated knife to slice the cake into 3 layers. Spread the jam across the 2 bottom cake layers, then reassemble the cake and set aside while you make the glaze. Put the cream, chocolate and honey in a medium pan and cook over a low-medium heat until the chocolate is melted and you have a smooth, pourable mixture. Put the cake on a wire rack set over a parchment-lined baking tray and pour over the glaze, making sure to cover the entire cake. Use a fish slice to carefully transfer the cake to a serving plate and allow the glaze to set. To decorate, dust with a little edible gold powder, if you like. Uniced, this cake will keep for up to 5 days. Once iced, enjoy within 3 days тАУ just keep in the fridge, but remove before serving and eat at room temperature.	3	\N	Polish	["перекус"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/piernik-polish-gingerbread	mealdb:53292	[{"id": "9043898b-382f-4e8d-8927-b46106f59a29", "name": "Несолёное масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "7649f0f5-1b77-434b-bacf-6c60e93fd78b", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "b74d4108-2abc-482f-87aa-8618ad523786", "name": "Мёд", "unit": "г", "grams": 95, "amount": 95, "ingredientId": "64170819-df8c-49fa-b2ec-29fe5932623f", "originalString": "95 г"}, {"id": "8989ef72-b7b4-4c0e-a387-2579458956e9", "name": "Коричневый сахар", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1d6fcd50-9e69-4015-9bea-1a9ae790690e", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "52aae696-88b0-4806-9ca5-ae97c967628d", "name": "Мука с разрыхлителем", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "2e0dba19-7842-4b59-afdb-1f9ca1518136", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "677870a0-3453-4c0b-9c4f-95f337b50718", "name": "Молотый имбирь", "unit": "г", "grams": 15, "amount": 15, "ingredientId": "06e865f7-d973-40ea-9663-5a108892f112", "originalString": "15 г"}, {"id": "07a82f29-3a90-432f-a540-3a320eb57860", "name": "Молотая корица", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "bd