the cake form.\r\nтЦв\r\nRoll out of the rest of the dough and slice into long strips. Lay the strips of dough across the cake in a grid. Don't worry of the strips break тАУ simply press them back together on the cake.\r\nтЦв\r\nGently brush the dough with egg wash.\r\nтЦв\r\nBake for about 45 minutes. The top of the cake should be golden brown while the almond filling will remain soft.	4	\N	Norway	["перекус"]	t	https://scandinaviancookbook.com/fyrstekake-norwegian-prince-cake/	mealdb:53131	[{"id": "4ac4ae66-638c-4976-a7c2-415f760529d0", "name": "Сахар", "unit": "г", "grams": 180, "amount": 180, "ingredientId": "f686d932-ccf2-4d50-9f23-2e0375fdd9d4", "originalString": "180 г"}, {"id": "7502048a-6258-4a53-a48f-3b9af91c5948", "name": "Ванильный экстракт", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "b614f73e-8060-4cfa-875b-64b6e12221ff", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "2621a662-e94d-4fc5-b334-de5be559dcff", "name": "Масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 160, "amount": 160, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "160 г"}, {"id": "1aa8b610-cda9-4b67-bf5a-803acf909e90", "name": "Яичные желтки", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "c5c468c1-d5d7-425e-9275-de6ea68f6e67", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "39055e55-e4a5-4ded-8a14-5bb7dbf2a274", "name": "Мука", "unit": "г", "grams": 480, "amount": 480, "ingredientId": "6b9d37d6-50b6-41f6-bc22-2376d8109821", "originalString": "480 г"}, {"id": "265cec63-2ced-4412-a556-962ca711d8a0", "name": "Разрыхлитель", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "972b3e3a-16f2-4ec2-b5e3-2bd543cca16d", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "986b7053-181f-4a67-a184-0ff9cd45ac2f", "name": "Орехи миндаля", "unit": "г", "grams": 360, "amount": 360, "ingredientId": "6f7a7055-1be6-4214-9e65-2ca39fe461da", "originalString": "360 г"}, {"id": "e6de46a2-2d23-4e7c-ad14-afd1861a80c4", "name": "Коричневый сахар", "unit": "г", "grams": 180, "amount": 180, "ingredientId": "1d6fcd50-9e69-40