hot milk over the eggs and cornflour, then cook on a low heat, continually whisking.\r\n\r\nSTEP 7\r\nAdd syrup to custard\r\nAdd the cooled sugar syrup to the custard and whisk until thickened slightly.\r\n\r\nSTEP 8\r\nPour custard into the tins\r\nPour the custard through a sieve. Pour into the pastry cases and bake for 15 minutes until the pastry is golden and the custard has darkened.\r\n\r\nSTEP 9\r\ncool and dust with icing sugar\r\nCool completely in the tins then sift over icing sugar and ground cinnamon to serve.	2	\N	Portuguese	["перекус"]	t	https://www.olivemagazine.com/recipes/baking-and-desserts/portuguese-custard-tarts/	mealdb:53046	[{"id": "08d57fb5-359a-42d3-a365-8430f6c24c58", "name": "Пшеничная мука", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "89fd83a9-9424-4975-a81b-218d640c70a2", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "84813f4d-eecb-417b-b463-0c3979402ec5", "name": "Сахарная пудра", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "0ae3eca4-e36e-42f4-ae8e-a3f42bcb8501", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "8345ecbb-8c2b-449d-9012-3e0701e50789", "name": "Слоёное тесто", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4ccd5ab0-8da3-414a-9cb0-b6cc27e05f73", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "9f412240-9a93-4265-aaa0-b690730c4861", "name": "Цедра лимона", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "0757638c-8d0f-45ab-8a86-5bd3d136f89b", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "3a064e27-8c6e-4da1-a948-705ed9fcbd67", "name": "Корица", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "c508be3b-b158-45c7-9a46-2326abea13d0", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "558c6b34-7513-4a30-b985-f34deb7e9a64", "name": "Яйца", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "2fc401b0-e772-47dd-bd82-3638f892a36d", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "d6dd1fb8-4d63-4b4e-a26f-1f745c343307", "name": "Яичные желтки", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "c5c468c1-d5d7-425e-9275-de6ea68f6e67", "origi