7f6543f6-87e7-4853-a5cd-2bd70b1146ab	Чаудер из моллюсков	lunch	457	13.7	20.6	50.9	{лактоза,глютен,морепродукты}	[{"name": "Моллюски", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Масло", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Бекон", "grams": 40}, {"name": "Лук", "grams": 75}, {"name": "Тимьян", "grams": 3}, {"name": "Лавровый лист", "grams": 3}, {"name": "Пшеничная мука", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Молоко", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Густые сливки", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Картофель", "grams": 150}, {"name": "Петрушка", "grams": 60}]	https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/rvtvuw1511190488.jpg	2026-05-03 20:15:37.636+00	2026-10-06 13:02:27.314+00	["моллюски", "моллю", "масло", "бекон", "лук", "тимьян", "тимья", "лавровый", "лавро", "лавров", "лист", "пшеничная", "пшени", "пшеничн", "мука", "молоко", "молок", "густые", "густы", "густ", "сливки", "сливк", "картофель", "карто", "петрушка", "петру"]	Rinse the clams in several changes of cold water and drain well. Tip the clams into a large pan with 500ml of water. Cover, bring to the boil and simmer for 2 mins until the clams have just opened. Tip the contents of the pan into a colander over a bowl to catch the clam stock. When cool enough to handle, remove the clams from their shells тАУ reserving a handful of empty shells for presentation if you want. Strain the clam stock into a jug, leaving any grit in the bottom of the bowl. You should have around 800ml stock.\r\nHeat the butter in the same pan and sizzle the bacon for 3-4 mins until it starts to brown. Stir in the onion, thyme and bay and cook everything gently for 10 mins until the onion is soft and golden. Scatter over the flour and stir in to make a sandy paste, cook for 2 mins more, then gradually stir in the clam stock then the milk and the cream.\r\nThrow in the potatoes, bring everything to a simmer and leave to bubble away gently for 10 mins or until the potatoes are cooked. Use a fork to crush a few of the potato chunks against the side of the pan to help thicken тАУ you still want lots of defined chunks though. Stir through the clam meat and the few clam shells, if you've gone down that route, and simmer for a minute to reheat. Season with plenty of black pepper and a little salt, if needed, then stir through the parsley just before ladling into bowls or hollowed-out crusty rolls.	2	\N	United States	["перекус"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/clam-chowder	mealdb:52840	[{"id": "dc100fec-e72f-4348-babb-bc67f2fb72f4", "name": "Моллюски", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "0f98c8d9-0abb-4679-a5ec-742c6d3cbf5a", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "a858cb9a-63e6-436e-b578-0a722f8fc419", "name": "Масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "2201291c-b6da-4037-ae4a-3ac28c38e970", "name": "Бекон", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "ef1d7f34-d582-48bc-823e-88538f2e6ff8", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "cb113328-2392-4026-b258-9ab9932eaeaa", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "dddeae72-9f6e-462a-8e3f-c5d687114bea", "name": "Тимьян", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "3a6a2c31-dbd7-492c-9fe4-89ce8bcf3db8", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "a4045b9e-9d5b-41ea-8909-7c6d1eba57be", "name": "Лавровый лист", "unit": "шт", "grams": 60, "amount": 1, "ingredientId": "74796ff2-897a-4931-9396-b51b81fda780", "originalString": "1 шт"}, {"id": "5a28c0d4-4462-496d-a63a-a37d6176d8a9", "name": "Пшеничная мука", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "89fd83a9-9424-4975-a81b-218d640c70a2", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "f8cfe043-9bf8-4aa6-a3f4-e2bbdf076840", "name": "Молоко", "unit": "мл", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "d106cc74-1977-4922-ba5e-2a79a179b0ab", "originalString": "50 мл"}, {"id": "c982a310-8b02-41ac-9a68-fc3d62fafd52", "name": "Густые сливки", "unit": "мл", "g