59f93c60-df77-4a7e-8b2b-03917e73fcfc	Шаурма с курицей и чесночным йогуртовым соусом	lunch	636	32.7	27.1	68.2	{лактоза}	[{"name": "Куриная грудка", "grams": 200}, {"name": "Чеснок", "grams": 150}, {"name": "Молотый кориандр", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Молотый тмин", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Молотый кардамон", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Перец кайенский", "grams": 3}, {"name": "Копчёная паприка", "grams": 3}, {"name": "Соль", "grams": 5}, {"name": "Лимонный сок", "grams": 200}, {"name": "Оливковое масло", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Греческий йогурт", "grams": 200}]	https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/hcg6l91763596970.jpg	2026-05-03 20:14:17.354+00	2026-10-06 15:06:14.953+00	["куриная", "курин", "грудка", "грудк", "чеснок", "чесно", "молотый", "молот", "кориандр", "кориа", "тмин", "кардамон", "карда", "перец", "кайенский", "кайен", "кайенск", "копченая", "копче", "копчен", "паприка", "папри", "соль", "лимонный", "лимон", "лимонн", "сок", "оливковое", "оливк", "оливков", "масло", "греческий", "грече", "греческ", "йогурт", "йогур"]	1\r\nStart by cutting your chicken up into reasonably small slices. Grab your ziplock bag and dump the freshly sliced chicken inside.\r\n2\r\nAdd garlic, coriander, cumin, cardomom, cayenne pepper, paprika, salt, pepper, lemon juice and olive oil to the bag. Close the bag and mix thoroughly. Place in fridge for 10-12 hours (shorter is fine but longer is better).\r\n3\r\nOnce ready to cook, heat your fry pan to medium-high and add a tiny bit of olive oil. Fry one side of all of your flatbreads until slightly toasty. Remove from pan, add enough oil to coat the fry pan. Put crumble fries into air fryer on 180 for 15 minutes shaking occasionally.\r\n4\r\nThe pan should be pretty hot by now, add the chicken in 2 batches (unless you have a big fry pan) to avoid overcrowding. The chicken should get a nice sear and darker colour which is perfect. Cook for a further 5-8 minutes or until cooked through. Repeat with next chicken batch.\r\n5\r\nWhile chicken is cooking, place your Greek yoghurt into a bowl. Combine garlic, finely chopped mint and parsley, squeeze or so of lemon and cumin. Combine and add salt to taste. In a small bowl, combine 1tsp garlic powder, paprika, cumin, onion powder, oregano, dried parsley, cayenne pepper (optional) mix and leave aside for fries.\r\n6\r\nSeason fries immediately once cooked and add salt to taste. Once the chicken is complete, serve immediately by laying out your flatbread, spreading the sauce evenly over the bread, add lettuce, onion, tomato, fries, chicken, feta and more sauce on top. Serve immediately.	3	\N	Saudi Arabian	["ужин"]	t	https://cookpad.com/eng/recipes/24343467?ref=search&search_term=saudi+arabia	mealdb:53218	[{"id": "4dd62c5a-073c-43ab-98e1-78e135fcd6a8", "name": "Куриная грудка", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "12c12878-ea46-4858-9358-8795cf84fcbb", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "4fa39625-60ac-4766-b89e-56b3d64d13cd", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "150 г"}, {"id": "c8a1cad4-6f9d-4a4b-9b89-a8bd1ae66c8f", "name": "Молотый кориандр", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "65e800a3-46d5-42d2-8e85-55e428effea4", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "139c48f3-795e-40db-af29-f1766d0462aa", "name": "Молотый тмин", "unit": "г", "grams": 55, "amount": 55, "ingredientId": "0858e27e-aeba-4065-8384-85c4d4fc62a5", "originalString": "55 г"}, {"id": "c11fbc74-709f-4d2d-bf81-b1e73a0603d2", "name": "Молотый кардамон", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "c54f7fa0-7b18-4e80-bd35-1d2a96175056", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "29dbdba3-3839-43c0-b291-b84087ff38a0", "name": "Перец кайенский", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "7cb60628-ad61-4cdb-b652-6e21ed928d1a", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "a98de758-e421-42f0-878f-16459fabac6d", "name": "Копчёная паприка", "unit": "г", "grams": 10, "amo