b47f8cdb-f618-4990-a924-b0ae6586cd8d	Шоколадное суфле	snack	688	18.8	46.1	50.7	{лактоза,яйца}	[{"name": "Лёгкие сливки", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Сахарная пудра", "grams": 120}, {"name": "Темный шоколад", "grams": 120}, {"name": "Масло", "grams": 120}, {"name": "Густые сливки", "grams": 180}, {"name": "Яичный желток", "grams": 180}, {"name": "Яичный белок", "grams": 240}]	https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/twspvx1511784937.jpg	2026-05-03 20:14:34.413+00	2026-10-06 13:10:30.479+00	["легкие", "легки", "сливки", "сливк", "сахарная", "сахар", "сахарн", "пудра", "темный", "темны", "темн", "шоколад", "шокол", "масло", "густые", "густы", "густ", "яичный", "яичны", "яичн", "желток", "желто", "белок"]	Heat oven to 220C/fan 200C/gas 7 and place a baking tray on the top shelf. For the sauce, heat the cream and sugar until boiling. Remove from the heat, stir in the chocolate and butter until melted, then keep warm.\r\nBrush 6 x 150ml ramekins with melted butter, sprinkle with the 2 tbsp caster sugar, then tip out any excess. Melt the chocolate and cream in a bowl over a pan of simmering water, cool, then mix in the egg yolks. Whisk the egg whites until they hold their shape, then add the sugar, 1 tbsp at a time, whisking back to the same consistency. Mix a spoonful into the chocolate, then gently fold in the rest.\r\nWorking quickly, fill the ramekins, wipe the rims clean and run your thumb around the edges. Turn oven down to 200C/fan 180C/gas 6, place the ramekins onto the baking tray, then bake for 8-10 mins until risen with a slight wobble. DonтАЩt open the oven door too early as this may make them collapse.\r\nOnce the souffl├йs are ready, dust with icing sugar, scoop a small hole from their tops, then pour in some of the hot chocolate sauce. Replace the lids and serve straight away.	4	\N	France	["перекус"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/5816/hot-chocolate-souffls-with-chocolate-cream-sauce	mealdb:52905	[{"id": "29423b47-aecc-41c2-98b8-9b8bc565c7c7", "name":