 other side.\r\nDrain the apples and potatoes and mash them together. Taste and add cinnamon and salt where needed. Remove the cinnamon stick before mashing	2	\N	Netherlands	["перекус"]	t	https://insimoneskitchen.com/hete-bliksem-recipe-hot-lightning/#recipe	mealdb:53389	[{"id": "b62e6304-4309-4326-ba02-c07c08b59c38", "name": "Яблоки", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "86ebb7c3-77fc-48d1-bced-09fa13f95133", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "b5ffe50f-aa67-4893-bcf4-e820c6d5443f", "name": "Картофель", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "99928917-5708-4040-aefa-1a6d06d27937", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "a7bcf66e-4ad6-46d3-adf4-e87f07da00c7", "name": "Корица (палочка)", "unit": "шт", "grams": 60, "amount": 1, "ingredientId": "7a2b21d6-41ff-4e4e-98bb-519247b1612f", "originalString": "1 шт"}, {"id": "68037e3b-7f09-438a-8930-7d33c2a62ab1", "name": "Кленовый сироп", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "58059657-b049-4346-8193-ab5b523a5f59", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "425d5d93-df23-4e4f-a989-6f7743c1092c", "name": "Молотая корица", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "bd59c7c9-4302-46cc-9554-f9762887d074", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "073787f8-86ab-4f2a-ab23-a65c7a7a1bce", "name": "Бекон", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "ef1d7f34-d582-48bc-823e-88538f2e6ff8", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "960d571f-183d-495a-94b8-d6199bae5a95", "name": "Сыр", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "f66ba678-5b96-4051-9194-87c34ad371d8", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "202bba62-c0f1-4974-a0ec-80089f1694ee", "name": "Соль", "unit": "г", "grams": 0.5, "amount": 0.5, "ingredientId": "3789cffa-31e4-49d0-bca4-aded4002f42c", "originalString": "0.5 г"}, {"id": "2a8b1541-18b1-42be-a11c-7d921563d9f9", "name": "Яйцо", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "cab42edd-5e3a-4893-839e-9f4ef50c6cf0", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "922