e more runny, then brush over the top of the tarts.\r\n\r\nTip the cr├иme fra├оche into a bowl, sift over the icing sugar and cardamom, and mix together. Carefully lift the warm tarts onto serving plates and serve with the cardamom cr├иme fra├оche.	3	\N	France	["перекус"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/chinon-apple-tarts	mealdb:52910	[{"id": "5ba2ddcc-da39-428c-8a22-5da208937ea0", "name": "Слоёное тесто", "unit": "г", "grams": 500, "amount": 500, "ingredientId": "4ccd5ab0-8da3-414a-9cb0-b6cc27e05f73", "originalString": "500 г"}, {"id": "c5ee6300-5d8e-46a2-b747-b58f9694164b", "name": "Сахар темный мягкий", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "30acacae-1fab-4160-a3ae-4e030d402e0b", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "cddb3dd0-2c65-43c4-bd4d-d86f7d24c383", "name": "Яблоки брейбёрн", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "862a6fa2-d7ff-4152-bdaa-afd33479e416", "originalString": "150 г"}, {"id": "9481fdd6-9733-4536-89ca-2c8207abdd28", "name": "Вино красное желе", "unit": "мл", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "fb2d45f4-e8fc-43dd-be3d-cdd229527aa0", "originalString": "200 мл"}, {"id": "9a55c062-447e-411e-a1f9-6a70defe009f", "name": "Крем фреш", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "dcee92e9-7848-4955-b497-a768e4bde1cd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "6d37f3e3-ba0a-4209-8743-7bec743941cf", "name": "Сахарная пудра", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "0ae3eca4-e36e-42f4-ae8e-a3f42bcb8501", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "93852d82-12ca-45bf-b40d-d9be22c6f933", "name": "Кардамон", "unit": "щепотка", "grams": 0.5, "amount": 1, "ingredientId": "5dd52155-0745-4004-84dd-6ef596f58f82", "originalString": "1 щепотка"}]	[]	t	\N
