08a0d064-eecb-4667-a07f-81566844b5f6	Сычуаньский баклажан с арахисом	snack	437	12.3	15.6	62.2	{арахис,яйца,соя}	[{"name": "Яйцо растительное", "grams": 55}, {"name": "Арахисовое масло", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Куриный бульон", "grams": 200}, {"name": "Сахар", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Соевый соус", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Чили паста", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Сычуаньский перец", "grams": 3}, {"name": "Имбирь", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Чеснок", "grams": 250}, {"name": "Кукурузный крахмал", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Яблочный уксус", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Лук зелёный", "grams": 225}, {"name": "Кинза", "grams": 60}]	https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/1oz4nb1765687990.jpg	2026-05-03 20:15:50.129+00	2026-10-06 15:06:14.97+00	["яйцо", "растительное", "расти", "растительн", "арахисовое", "арахи", "арахисов", "масло", "куриный", "курин", "бульон", "бульо", "сахар", "соевый", "соевы", "соев", "соус", "чили", "паста", "сычуаньский", "сычуа", "сычуаньск", "перец", "имбирь", "имбир", "чеснок", "чесно", "кукурузный", "кукур", "кукурузн", "крахмал", "крахм", "яблочный", "яблоч", "яблочн", "уксус", "лук", "зеленый", "зелен", "кинза"]	This recipe calls for asian eggplants, or Japanese eggplants. They are long and thin compared to a European or globe eggplant, and much more tender and delicate. If you can't find them you can substitute globe eggplant, but the dish is really best with the asian eggplant.\r\n\r\n*A lot of grocery stores have Asian ingredient aisles now. You should be able to find chili-bean paste, a mixture of preserved chilies mixed with mashed soybeans, there or at any Asian market. (Do not confuse with black bean paste or chili-garlic paste.)\r\n\r\n**Sichuan peppercorns are available at some stores and online for quite cheap. They aren't spicy like other peppers but rather have a citrusy flavor and induce a tingly, numbing sensation like a carbonated drink.\r\n\r\nPrep eggplant, chili sauce, cornstarch slurry, vinegar and scallions:\r\nBegin your mise en place. Quarter the eggplant lengthwise and chop into large batons and set aside.\r\n\r\nIn a small bowl, mix together the chicken stock, sugar, and soy sauce and set it aside.\r\n\r\nIn a second bowl, mix together the chili bean paste, garlic, ginger, and sichuan peppercorns and set it aside.\r\n\r\nIn a third bowl, mix together the cornstarch with a tablespoon of water and set it aside.\r\n\r\nLastly, in a fourth bowl, mix together the scallions and vinegar and set it aside.\r\n\r\nSaut├й eggplant:\r\nPlace the oil in a wok or large saut├й pan over medium-high heat until the oil is almost smoking. Add the eggplant and saut├й, allowing it to sit for a few seconds each time you move it to allow it to brown and blister. If the eggplant absorbs all the oil and some pieces don't get any then add a little more oil.\r\n\r\nAdd the chili bean paste, garlic, ginger, and sichuan peppercorns and saut├й:\r\nuntil fragrant, about 30 seconds.\r\n\r\nAdd the chicken stock mixture:\r\nturn the heat to medium-low and simmer for 90 seconds.\r\n\r\nAdd the cornstarch mixture:\r\nand stir together until the sauce thickens a bit.\r\n\r\nAdd the scallions and vinegar:\r\nand cook for 15 seconds to diffuse their harsh flavors a bit.\r\n\r\nGarnish with cilantro and serve.	3	\N	Chinese	["ужин"]	t	https://www.simplyrecipes.com/recipes/sichuan_eggplant/	mealdb:53374	[{"id": "76c759d9-92c2-4e35-9eb8-cd0a5482e2b8", "name": "Яйцо растительное", "unit": "г", "grams": 75, "amount": 75, "ingredientId": "2d79fe84-c8bd-431c-aafd-8470cdab2906", "originalString": "75 г"}, {"id": "d162c702-4482-421a-8525-3f7be19016dc", "name": "Арахисовое масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 30, "amount": 30, "ingredientId": "b2191b9b-6b41-496a-a343-1a7e3d1f36ac", "originalString": "30 г"}, {"id": "ad15444f-a99a-4db6-bba4-dc66106d7716", "name": "Куриный бульон", "unit": "мл", "grams": 60, "amount": 60, "ingredientId": "91e363d7-dd45-4ec9-9fec-998b79337f1d", "originalString": "60 мл"}, {"id": "74b81ad6-0b72-4add-af56-b5f1cc6d3427