antains brown, continue to add more cooking oil spray, salt and pepper (if needed) until they have reached the desired color and texture.\r\nRemove and serve with kale	2	\N	Jamaican	["ужин"]	t	https://www.africanbites.com/callaloo-jamaican-style/	mealdb:52939	[{"id": "c13915b7-9bee-4a43-9edc-aecf7d311d06", "name": "Кейл", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "3528f97b-b49f-4205-a255-a91334513983", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "f6310cd2-2b6e-460a-a693-573d13b5285d", "name": "Бекон", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "ef1d7f34-d582-48bc-823e-88538f2e6ff8", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "400807fc-88d5-4fa9-a8eb-ab426b9b045f", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "150 г"}, {"id": "94e21e18-e76f-46ed-a7ef-2817d0f9d388", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "20e97533-bd8e-4537-9766-2f67814d06e8", "name": "Паприка", "unit": "г", "grams": 2.5, "amount": 2.5, "ingredientId": "85045806-3a18-4d35-ad01-0230c0cb98d2", "originalString": "2.5 г"}, {"id": "f4d405ed-7796-4f86-a112-04e319fe9c13", "name": "Тимьян", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "3a6a2c31-dbd7-492c-9fe4-89ce8bcf3db8", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "5a1eb8b8-9af5-4516-9677-4360ff3c52cd", "name": "Помидор", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "56af0c35-84c3-4e11-8c83-f306df2b10eb", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "68ff03ea-16fc-4060-821b-21cc48eb68d0", "name": "Красный перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "8f4685b1-4b0f-407f-a77e-e4b3205c8ca6", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "2f217b8e-cad1-40c7-934c-c414857e4ff0", "name": "Банан", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "351a7999-d3b6-414d-beaf-56455985f75c", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "b8c85c44-d017-40d2-b176-6