 simmer and cook, covered, in the low oven.\r\n\r\nAfter 2 hours, check the meat and add the beans. Cook for a further hour and just before serving, pull the meat apart with a pair of forks.	3	\N	Mexican	["ужин"]	t	http://www.telegraph.co.uk/food-and-drink/recipes/braised-beef-chilli-con-carne/	mealdb:52826	[{"id": "d60cd939-a2ff-4a01-97b6-b8c9bd3b166b", "name": "Говядина", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "6faa9697-3013-4635-a452-09e75c62051a", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "96bb876d-3a7c-4ce9-a39c-31cb3936bf34", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "150 г"}, {"id": "7a59e62c-71d5-4ac7-a8d0-a21decb488b8", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "28af3ee7-6c96-4f12-b98f-4be3109ceba6", "name": "Оливковое масло", "unit": "мл", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "50 мл"}, {"id": "91565025-072d-44a4-b522-95a656539dea", "name": "Чоризо", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "fdcea699-5c46-451c-8560-12484bf07b54", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "54f13c4d-10ca-4f59-a998-239d78193fa9", "name": "Тмин", "unit": "г", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "d3ebda74-17c3-45b6-8ddd-82a44f0d652e", "originalString": "10 г"}, {"id": "b2914d79-21c2-4b50-8087-343116db5b56", "name": "Ароматный перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "314bbdc9-2b4f-4660-838f-6f6fb300808e", "originalString": "10 г"}, {"id": "6b2b9829-c274-4527-8ced-866f2d17b793", "name": "Гвоздика", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "dfbbaba4-1f1d-40e2-949c-06b7a6a78217", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "beb3c912-54f2-4554-b390-ec051c51e7e3", "name": "Корица", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "c508be3b-b158-45c7-9a46-2326abea13d0", "or