h the consistency you desire. Taste for seasoning and add more salt if necessary.\r\nServe with crushed-up crackers, torn up bread, or something else to add some extra thickness.  You could also use a traditional thickener (like cornstarch or flour), but I prefer to add crackers for some texture and saltiness.  Makes great leftovers, stays good in the fridge for about a week.	5	\N	Turkish	["перекус"]	t	https://findingtimeforcooking.com/main-dishes/red-lentil-soup-corba/	mealdb:52977	[{"id": "fd5ae1ab-565c-407a-85ed-318b61a33339", "name": "Чечевица", "unit": "г", "grams": 240, "amount": 240, "ingredientId": "1b10ff3b-7ca7-4881-b398-a51246899ca6", "originalString": "240 г"}, {"id": "f74fda94-c9e9-414c-9e25-212b5dfd251e", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "e19a5a13-bbf1-4cec-a80c-aa21253e419e", "name": "Морковь", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "3ab14c63-202a-4334-b30c-9674ce7ef8fd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "45e53490-39c9-43a3-9225-82702a0948c6", "name": "Томатное пюре", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "25b50206-3ccf-49c0-9a94-48b439c1bc25", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "187bb50c-c6b7-412d-8f8d-bc3d8c20c536", "name": "Тмин", "unit": "г", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "d3ebda74-17c3-45b6-8ddd-82a44f0d652e", "originalString": "10 г"}, {"id": "dd459512-ce85-46b3-a790-d5d7d08e23fc", "name": "Паприка", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "85045806-3a18-4d35-ad01-0230c0cb98d2", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "57dc9d09-38e3-4126-afff-b2d6e96887b4", "name": "Мята", "unit": "г", "grams": 2.5, "amount": 2.5, "ingredientId": "907378d6-aa5d-485c-8d83-34ef4fbc07d8", "originalString": "2.5 г"}, {"id": "97542a60-f1d0-4fe4-a854-5ca563938361", "name": "Тимьян", "unit": "г", "grams": 2.5, "amount": 2.5, "ingredientId": "3a6a2c31-dbd7-492c-9fe4-89ce8bcf3db8", "originalString": "2.5 г"