 10 minutes, then release the remaining pressure.\r\nOnce all the pressure has been released, open the pressure cooker. Place on saut├й for 10-15 minutes, add potatoes and a whole scotch bonnet pepper. Cook until potatoes have softened. Remove scotch bonnet pepper.	3	\N	Jamaican	["завтрак"]	t	https://www.myforkinglife.com/jamaican-curry-goat/#recipe	mealdb:53354	[{"id": "dc2d9851-be76-4eb4-8ec2-655005745fc3", "name": "Козлятина", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "21d4fd89-6870-43f4-b396-e28988a47f25", "originalString": "150 г"}, {"id": "581d562e-56a0-4956-abbe-7b354beb357c", "name": "Ямайский карри-порошок", "unit": "г", "grams": 37.5, "amount": 37.5, "ingredientId": "85f9fe20-9283-41dd-82a9-68dbc9fee1c5", "originalString": "37.5 г"}, {"id": "bc33e6a5-388b-451e-8fc2-c8b557c2f1a2", "name": "Молотый имбирь", "unit": "г", "grams": 2.5, "amount": 2.5, "ingredientId": "06e865f7-d973-40ea-9663-5a108892f112", "originalString": "2.5 г"}, {"id": "1ea7046a-9fde-48ee-b509-dfb48e28c2c0", "name": "Универсальная приправа", "unit": "г", "grams": 2.5, "amount": 2.5, "ingredientId": "223f163f-6fa9-4368-982f-bae66cf3727c", "originalString": "2.5 г"}, {"id": "52ea0d1d-3104-4c72-87ac-51685868b1c0", "name": "Перечная лавровая приправа", "unit": "г", "grams": 1.3, "amount": 1.3, "ingredientId": "5c51b93f-0459-42e8-944a-f312dfd947e3", "originalString": "1.3 г"}, {"id": "77881741-6e55-4da7-8547-df73a1a24fcb", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "6357409a-78f6-426e-bb65-4b79ea41def9", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 300, "amount": 300, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "300 г"}, {"id": "26222e4a-3d9c-4e88-8d7d-cac8464620a7", "name": "Тимьян", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "3a6a2c31-dbd7-492c-9fe4-89ce8bcf3db8", "originalString": "150 г"}, {"id": "781c3347-4157-4ef2-a942-e1791198473a",