eces, until browned and cooked through, 4-6 minutes.\r\n\r\n5\r\n\r\nWhile pork cooks, in a third small bowl, combine BBQ sauce, pickling liquid from onion, 3 TBSP ketchup (6 TBSP for 4 servings), ┬╜ tsp sugar (1 tsp for 4), and ┬╝ cup water (тЕУ cup for 4). Once pork is cooked through, add BBQ sauce mixture to pan. Cook, stirring, until sauce is thickened, 2-3 minutes. Taste and season with salt and pepper.\r\n\r\n6\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, toast buns in oven or toaster oven until golden, 3-5 minutes. Divide toasted buns between plates and fill with as much BBQ pork as youтАЩd like. Top with pickled onion and hot sauce. Serve with sweet potato wedges on the side.	3	\N	United States	["ужин"]	t	\N	mealdb:52995	[{"id": "a7ee2408-f3ee-4d86-b06e-6d1454392c95", "name": "Картофель", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "99928917-5708-4040-aefa-1a6d06d27937", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "debf6da1-72fd-4059-a16d-16ee8ac86008", "name": "Красный лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "e90c3874-7702-443d-a509-8a57053c11cc", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "c5ef8b80-c238-4f39-b3bf-6998f8a98f8c", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "4f8f0cd6-fa84-4a7b-9295-f6d451877598", "name": "Лайм", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "d69a6d78-fb1a-455e-8c7a-0fb3887dfa17", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "26e85300-7209-426e-9dd2-c3afdacd3442", "name": "Хлеб", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "c91eb3ce-ad08-438e-b020-4408afd585f3", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "d872d657-98de-4adb-856e-818dcf51e39c", "name": "Свинина", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4aeae1ae-8a32-41ea-af48-7828e4bd26a6", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "fd6c7b9b-eceb-410a-8612-98695f34824c", "name": "Барбекю соус", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "75dfef05-6ae4-4ad