as used for cooking the beef, along with enough extra water to cover. Bring to a boil, reduce heat, and simmer, uncovered, stirring occasionally, for about 1 hour, or until the meat is tender and the sauce is thickened. Add additional water if your beef curry begins to dry and stick, or if would like your curry to have more of a soupy consistency.\r\nWhen the beef curry is ready, remove from the heat, give it a taste, and adjust the seasonings as desired. Garnish with fresh chilis and cilantro.	3	\N	Kenyan	["ужин"]	t	https://tasteoftheplace.com/kenyan-beef-curry/	mealdb:53112	[{"id": "e207de38-502e-41d3-a457-d5091fe1a47a", "name": "Вода", "unit": "мл", "grams": 960, "amount": 960, "ingredientId": "1eec42eb-3a97-4791-8cb2-da60cef6bc13", "originalString": "960 мл"}, {"id": "63e662fe-370c-48c2-b9db-777bb056df0f", "name": "Говяжья вырезка", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "41643828-db47-4e6d-9ad7-9b56cdacc848", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "d633283f-8b91-4ddc-a3b9-f96f0f6e6d24", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "d9970735-e611-4399-9407-e9059065d8a6", "name": "Молотый имбирь", "unit": "г", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "06e865f7-d973-40ea-9663-5a108892f112", "originalString": "10 г"}, {"id": "731a1e68-1eda-4d4a-8ffd-aa5c75454a7d", "name": "Масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "11c47778-76aa-497e-9059-1af6915949ba", "name": "Красный лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "e90c3874-7702-443d-a509-8a57053c11cc", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "7df15203-b475-475c-b136-99968c2de0ef", "name": "Помидор", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "56af0c35-84c3-4e11-8c83-f306df2b10eb", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "fee447ec-3342-4c42-ae7d-cc13ece5a795", "name": "Папр