 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "aa8ad412-c549-4641-a893-52e7eef21b1f", "originalString": "10 мл"}, {"id": "408c5d84-f094-4675-a1c6-791ce6ef71d5", "name": "Сахарный сироп", "unit": "мл", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "6f5050f8-d9dc-4865-ac13-06ff29642610", "originalString": "10 мл"}, {"id": "0b086964-6645-4546-8fee-eb79fd057544", "name": "Сок лайма", "unit": "мл", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "3b78a1c8-c46b-4b4e-ade8-91edd830007e", "originalString": "50 мл"}, {"id": "881e85d2-038d-4c0f-9dd3-31d08c3ca3cf", "name": "Мята", "unit": "г", "grams": 250, "amount": 250, "ingredientId": "907378d6-aa5d-485c-8d83-34ef4fbc07d8", "originalString": "250 г"}]	[]	t	\N
7471031d-b436-4085-a242-850b193d7e52	Копчёное баклажановое пюре	dinner	114	4.8	1.8	20.3	{лактоза}	[{"name": "Баклажан", "grams": 120}, {"name": "Лимон", "grams": 100}, {"name": "Чеснок", "grams": 150}, {"name": "Йогурт", "grams": 100}, {"name": "Укроп", "grams": 60}]	https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/8c8m4q1763791156.jpg	2026-05-03 20:15:35.921+00	2026-10-06 13:10:30.473+00	["баклажан", "бакла", "лимон", "чеснок", "чесно", "йогурт", "йогур", "укроп"]	step 1\r\nHeat grill to very hot. Slice the aubergines in half lengthways, then grill for 25 mins, turning occasionally, until soft тАУ the skin will remain firm, but the flesh will soften. Lift the aubergines off the grill and leave until cool enough to handle.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nUsing a sharp knife, score the grilled flesh and scoop out the flesh with a spoon. Tip into a bowl and mash with a fork until you get a thick pulp. Beat in the lemon juice and garlic. Add the yogurt and dill, and season. Serve while still warm.	2	\N	Turkish	["перекус"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/smoked-aubergine-puree	mealdb:53259	[{"id": "a9b5fdc1-6a00-4d0e-912e-669a27a4ddb0", "name": "Баклажан", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "2abb6236-93df-48a2-8005-fbea3b142357", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "3b805131-3db0-4a30-ba65-0ddcae0d4563", "name": "Лимон", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "2424a9f1-7d3e-4caf-afdf-ea30bcef37d0", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "c49da77a-741b-41a7-821a-b764e9cccb5b", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "150 г"}, {"id": "993c2e57-ae3e-48ce-b2a3-8b1a1189d862", "name": "Йогурт", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "e9b843f3-809a-4141-a294-cf91e81ffcd4", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "dc8de5c5-2325-40f9-bbde-1da1a939baac", "name": "Укроп", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "7254434c-1f85-4553-abf2-31c57