, sun-dried tomatoes and garlic and cook for 2-3 minutes. Add the rice, stirring to ensure it is well coated in the oil. Stir in the tomato paste, paprika, bay leaves and chopped thyme. Pour in the stock and wine. When the liquid starts to bubble, turn the heat down to a gentle simmer. Press the rice down into the liquid if it isn't already submerged and place the chicken on top. Add the lemon wedges and olives around the chicken.\r\n\r\nCover and cook in the oven for 50 minutes. The rice should be cooked but still have some bite, and the chicken should have juices that run clear when pierced in the thickest part with a knife. If not, cook for another 5 minutes and check again.	6	\N	France	["ужин"]	t	https://www.rivercottage.net/recipes/chicken-basquaise	mealdb:52934	[{"id": "17f254f7-77ba-40ac-8a3a-84fc3ad658dc", "name": "Курица", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "fde4920d-1aea-40db-ab56-10941a2d8d85", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "1d2b0d1a-e454-48d8-b075-bad07db333e7", "name": "Масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "9933d95a-71f1-47cd-b4e6-83771a405bdd", "name": "Оливковое масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 300, "amount": 300, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "300 г"}, {"id": "d03eb6ad-1c1a-4ed3-a71c-de70f91b78b0", "name": "Красный лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "e90c3874-7702-443d-a509-8a57053c11cc", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "eea3b97a-b5aa-437d-aeb1-760b2ac35a20", "name": "Красный перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "8f4685b1-4b0f-407f-a77e-e4b3205c8ca6", "originalString": "150 г"}, {"id": "aaec9679-1d4f-42f6-a2c8-fcf86931215d", "name": "Чоризо", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "fdcea699-5c46-451c-8560-12484bf07b54", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "fb029cdf-3121-47d2-9398-573130c09761", "name": "Вяленые 