pread the remaining marinade on the chicken. Roast for 35-45 minutes or until internal temp of the thickest part of chicken is at least 175 F.\r\nLet chicken rest for 5 minutes. Brush the chicken with some of the oil. Serve chicken with the sauce over steamed rice (or coconut rice).	6	\N	Malaysian	["ужин"]	t	http://www.curiousnut.com/roasted-spiced-chicken-ayam-percik/	mealdb:53050	[{"id": "45c89160-c372-4214-8119-ad9d6ec227db", "name": "Куриные бёдра", "unit": "г", "grams": 300, "amount": 300, "ingredientId": "4408ccda-a27e-4db6-bc16-bef8099e89a5", "originalString": "300 г"}, {"id": "0c509e7c-bdc4-4790-ac91-59e56a4105fa", "name": "Шалот", "unit": "г", "grams": 800, "amount": 800, "ingredientId": "96e7459f-b4cf-4269-a5d5-8083754fb5f4", "originalString": "800 г"}, {"id": "c95fa1b5-4dc9-4026-ae30-0a8868028fa5", "name": "Имбирь", "unit": "г", "grams": 75, "amount": 75, "ingredientId": "245533a8-d5cb-4feb-9254-2f888a3b4f85", "originalString": "75 г"}, {"id": "1bada4b0-3464-47eb-b55e-87fcc54bc7b9", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 300, "amount": 300, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "300 г"}, {"id": "4350940c-8fa1-4d49-ade4-00856f459232", "name": "Перец кайенский", "unit": "г", "grams": 400, "amount": 400, "ingredientId": "7cb60628-ad61-4cdb-b652-6e21ed928d1a", "originalString": "400 г"}, {"id": "7c88335b-28a4-4058-9502-9a8b9b4990bd", "name": "Куркума", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "e9900362-e715-4c27-a1a7-e7f4837aec69", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "d19becb5-964e-4f09-b677-12fdbf12ac01", "name": "Тмин", "unit": "г", "grams": 75, "amount": 75, "ingredientId": "d3ebda74-17c3-45b6-8ddd-82a44f0d652e", "originalString": "75 г"}, {"id": "3c815c8e-a53a-4b70-b07c-b6bd55d28804", "name": "Кориандр", "unit": "г", "grams": 75, "amount": 75, "ingredientId": "52d1a2ee-7393-4457-ad02-60b13081000a", "originalString": "75 г"}, {"id": "fa2048fc-3fb4-41d9-8f77-446fc70dae23", "name": "Фенхель", "unit": "г", 