a88d293a-77ed-461c-be7b-3c16c8a4582d	Курица с ананасами	lunch	332	20.2	5.3	50	{лактоза,яйца,морепродукты}	[{"name": "Куриные бёдра", "grams": 200}, {"name": "Яйцо", "grams": 55}, {"name": "Кошерная соль", "grams": 5}, {"name": "Кукурузный крахмал", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Ананас, кусочки", "grams": 480}, {"name": "Ананасовый сок", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Уксус", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Помидорный кетчуп", "grams": 120}, {"name": "Коричневый сахар", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Масло", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Красный перец", "grams": 3}, {"name": "Желтый перец", "grams": 3}, {"name": "Имбирь", "grams": 60}]	https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/arzs741766434335.jpg	2026-05-03 20:14:24.82+00	2026-10-06 13:02:27.097+00	["куриные", "курин", "бедра", "яйцо", "кошерная", "кошер", "кошерн", "соль", "кукурузный", "кукур", "кукурузн", "крахмал", "крахм", "ананас", "анана", "кусочки", "кусоч", "ананасовый", "ананасов", "сок", "уксус", "помидорный", "помид", "помидорн", "кетчуп", "кетчу", "коричневый", "корич", "коричнев", "сахар", "масло", "красный", "красн", "перец", "желтый", "желты", "желт", "имбирь", "имбир"]	Coat the chicken with egg white:\r\nIn a bowl, combine the chicken with the egg white, 1/2 teaspoon kosher salt, and cornstarch. Stir to coat the chicken evenly. Let sit for 15 minutes at room temperature or up to overnight in the refrigerator.\r\n\r\nMake the sweet and sour sauce:\r\nWhisk together the pineapple juice, vinegar, ketchup, 1/2 teaspoon kosher salt, and brown sugar.\r\n\r\nStir-fry the chicken over high heat:\r\nHeat a large frying pan or wok over high heat until a bead of water instantly sizzles and evaporates. Pour in 1 tablespoon of cooking oil and swirl to coat. It's important that the pan is very hot.\r\n\r\nAdd the chicken and spread the pieces out in one layer. Let the chicken fry untouched for 1 minute, until the bottoms are browned.\r\n\r\nFlip and fry the other side for 1 minute. The chicken should still be pinkish in the middle. Dish out the chicken onto a clean plate, leaving as much oil in the pan as possible.\r\n\r\nStir-fry the bell pepper and ginger:\r\nReduce the heat to medium and add the remaining 1 teaspoon of cooking oil. Let the oil heat up before adding the bell pepper chunks and ginger. Fry for 1 minute.\r\n\r\nAdd the pineapple, sauce, and then, the chicken:\r\nAdd the pineapple chunks and the sweet and sour sauce. Turn up the heat to high. When the sauce is simmering, add the chicken pieces back in.\r\n\r\nLet simmer for 1 to 2 minutes, until the chicken is cooked through. Timing depends on how thick you've cut your chicken. The best way to tell if the chicken is done is to take a piece out and cut into it. If it's pink, add another minute to the cooking.\r\n\r\nAdjust the seasoning and serve:\r\nTaste the sauce and add more brown sugar or vinegar to suit your tastes, if youтАЩd like.\r\n\r\nServe hot with steamed white or brown rice.	4	\N	Chinese	["ужин"]	t	https://www.simplyrecipes.com/recipes/sweet_and_sour_chicken/	mealdb:53376	[{"id": "96770ad2-8a54-4905-9a78-9e11edcaaddf", "name": "Куриные бёдра", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4408ccda-a27e-4db6-bc16-bef8099e89a5", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "65e398ef-b992-4e6a-a9dd-707af3706f62", "name": "Яйцо", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "cab42edd-5e3a-4893-839e-9f4ef50c6cf0", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "8c8e6aa3-fffb-4d6f-b19d-c589d52dd930", "name": "Кошерная соль", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "a5e7a151-2642-4ae0-9e8a-f7d55cde3783", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "8c19913e-ed28-4a35-9905-f482541841d0", "name": "Кукурузный крахмал", "unit": "г", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "41137d44-eccd-4d8e-b985-ca171a3b3a50", "originalString": "10 г"}, {"id": "cc3d5d3f-1d3f-4f6a-be71-5d3b9b940b0e", "name": "Ананас, кусочки", "unit": "г", "grams": 500, "amount": 500, "ingredientId": "9b523df2-0165-475f-b478-07a805d49cfd", "originalString": "500 г"}, {"id": "23be402c-9607-4ee0-bcba-0c655ae0bea2", "name": "Ананасовый сок", "unit": "мл", "grams": 60, "amount": 60, "ingredientId": "c0a0b3a7-56f7-46d6-bc1c-a87bf0170b6e", "originalString": "60 мл"}, {"id": "0e13ab28-a09a-4f29-8b7f-bc4b248b53af", "name": "Уксус", "unit": "мл", "grams": 60, "amount": 60, "ingredientId": "1f86ebc2-e34b-4343-a0b3-1fc42654ad26", "originalString": "60 мл"}, {"id": "600bbfb5-17ed-46d1-9509-d5b55a7ba9a7", "name": "Помидорный кетчуп", "unit": "г", "grams": 60, "amount": 60, "ingredientId": "26931567-3a97-4f2d-b543-f7b2f88a261b", "originalString": "60 г"}, {"id": "cb590d13-c548-4dc2-8ddd-2c13ea1e28f5", "name": "Коричневый сахар", "unit": "г", "grams": 45, "amount": 45, "ingredientId": "1d6fcd50-9e69-4015-9bea-1a9ae790690e", "originalString": "45 г"}, {"id": "f5262eef-2854-458a-8c45-1a42f655d9bf", "name": "Масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 20, "amount": 20, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "20 г"}, {"id": "5ab4ad16-1a47-4160-b4fa-e400414a6152", "name": "Красный перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "8f4685b1-4b0f-407f-a77e-e4b3205c8ca6", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "c92a90e9-a05e-4661-b97b-9df63fca2d4e", "name": "Желтый перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "9ef41b35-16d3-4752-8ab0-698c0d4da8ca", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "2f3d8c8f-7398-4b51-aeb0-8ab1ee1600db", "name": "Имбирь", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "245533a8-d5cb-4feb-9254-2f888a3b4f85", "originalString": "5 г"}]	["gluten-free"]	t	\N
b4f65cc4-70f6-4402-9340-7ecebcb34488	Курица с жареным рисом	lunch	783	29.4	15.2	131.1	{лактоза,глютен,яйца,соя,кунжут}	[{"name": "Куриные бёдра", "grams": 200}, {"name": "Соль", "grams": 5}, {"name": "Масло канолы", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Яйцо", "grams": 165}, {"name": "Лук", "grams": 150}, {"name": "Чеснок", "grams": 100}, {"name": "Имбирь молотый", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Морковь", "grams": 80}, {"name": "Горох", "grams": 180}, {"name": "Жасминовый рис", "grams": 960}, {"name": "Зеленый лук", "grams": 75}, {"name": "Китайские пять специй", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Соевый соус", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Кунжутное масло", "grams": 60}]	https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/wuyd2h1765655837.jpg	2026-05-03 20:14:15.456+00	2026-10-06 13:02:27.471+00	["куриные", "курин", "бедра", "соль", "масло", "канолы", "канол", "яйцо", "лук", "чеснок", "чесно", "имбирь", "имбир", "молотый", "молот", "морковь", "морко", "горох", "жасминовый", "жасми", "жасминов", "жасмин", "рис", "зеленый", "зелен", "китайские", "китай", "пять", "специй", "специ", "спец", "соевый", "соевы", "соев", "соус", "кунжутное", "кунжу", "кунжутн"]	Fried rice is best made with leftover rice that's at least a day old. Otherwise it becomes gummy in the skillet.\r\nIf you donтАЩt have any leftover rice from the night before, cook a batch of rice and spread it on a large baking sheet or several large plates. Let the rice dry out for about 1 to 2 hours before using it for fried rice.\r\n\r\nRice sticks to the pan very easily, so make sure to use a wok or pan that doesnтАЩt have a sticky surface. I usually cook stir-fries in my seasoned carbon steel wok, but cast iron or nonstick pans work well, too. You might need to add a little more oil if things arenтАЩt releasing easily.\r\n\r\nPrepare the chicken:\r\nChop the chicken into small 1/4-inch to 1/2-inch cubes. Sprinkle 1/2 teaspoon of salt over the chicken and mix to combine. Set the chicken aside for about 10 minutes (I usually use this time to chop all the vegetables).\r\n\r\nScramble the egg:\r\nHeat a wok or large saut├й pan over medium-high heat. Swirl in a tablespoon of oil and add the whisked eggs. Use a spatula to quickly scramble the eggs, breaking the curds into smaller pieces as they come together. Transfer the eggs to a plate.\r\n\r\nCook the chicken:\r\nAdd another tablespoon of oil in the wok or pan. Add the chicken and cook for 4 to 5 minutes, stirring occasionally. Turn off the heat and transfer the cooked chicken to a plate.\r\n\r\nUsing your spatula, scrape off any chicken bits that are still stuck to the wok so they don't burn during the next step. You can also use paper towels to wipe down your wok or pan.\r\n\r\nCook the vegetables:\r\nSwirl 1 tablespoon of oil into the wok over medium-high heat. Add the diced onions and cook them for 1 minute, until they start to soften. Mix in the minced garlic and ginger and cook until fragrant, about 30 seconds. Add the diced carrots and cook for 2 minutes, stirring frequently. Add 1/2 teaspoon salt and the peas, and stir to incorporate.\r\n\r\nCook the rice:\r\nAdd the rice to the wok or pan on top of the vegetables and stir to combine. Using the back of your spatula, smash any large chunks of rice to break them apart. Add the white and green parts of the sliced scallions (save the dark green parts) and five-spice powder. Stir to incorporate. If the rice starts to stick to the pan, stir in a little more oil.\r\n\r\nDrizzle the soy sauce and sesame oil over the rice and stir to incorporate. Stir in the cooked chicken, scrambled eggs, and the dark parts of the scallions. Stir briefly to bring it together, and cook for another 1 to 2 minutes.\r\n\r\nServe:\r\nTaste, and add more soy sauce if necessary. Serve immediately.	7	\N	Chinese	["ужин"]	t	https://www.simplyrecipes.com/recipes/chicken_fried_rice/	mealdb:53367	[{"id": "dd6e1969-b5fe-4984-b095-6826ddd88116", "name": "Куриные бёдра", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4408ccda-a27e-4db6-bc1