ing stock, arrange the lemon wedges on top and cover with a lid or some aluminium foil. Cook for a further 10 minutes.\r\n\r\n4 To ensure you get the classic layer of toasted rice at the bottom of the pan, increase the heat to high until you hear a slight crackle. Remove from the heat and sit for 5 minutes before sprinkling over the parsley and serving.	3	\N	Spanish	["ужин"]	t	https://www.homestylemag.co.uk/recipe/517/main-courses/roast-fennel-and-aubergine-paella	mealdb:52942	[{"id": "dfe00655-cead-49d5-808e-ac9024a3a330", "name": "Молодой баклажан", "unit": "г", "grams": 300, "amount": 300, "ingredientId": "cc0c0259-c192-464d-afd6-da8ee30e78ea", "originalString": "300 г"}, {"id": "c8f04a7f-9964-477d-9d74-53f55b2b7349", "name": "Фенхель", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "d40fddb0-274e-4ca3-89ae-fd7a994e1a52", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "56704add-2e65-4d79-9424-fc1c76203821", "name": "Красный перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "8f4685b1-4b0f-407f-a77e-e4b3205c8ca6", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "038af072-7c69-45ae-a2c8-6f5166f32f66", "name": "Цукини", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1ef22ac1-6d20-4418-a66e-51ab1fc31a03", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "c427148e-1197-4713-b862-cceb1c116e99", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "8177dac8-3641-4862-b75a-e952c41b95c7", "name": "Рис для паэльи", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "3260331b-c748-4917-a55c-eb34c758dbb0", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "e05c5c7c-caa7-435e-b993-2911898d0ee6", "name": "Паприка", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "85045806-3a18-4d35-ad01-0230c0cb98d2", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "5a5dafe8-d9fd-425d-aed2-8cbd78b573b4", "name": "Шафран", "unit": "г", "grams": 0.5, "amount": 0.5, "ingredientId": "f1effc80-8255-48f1-af11-683d65dbed62", "originalSt