4be381ef-af58-4ba8-a2a7-d6ac6eebea6b	Пончики	snack	855	28	43.2	90.1	{лактоза,глютен,яйца,орехи}	[{"name": "Дрожжи", "grams": 3}, {"name": "Сахарная пудра", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Мука", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Молоко", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Яйца", "grams": 330}, {"name": "Сахар", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Ванильный экстракт", "grams": 3}, {"name": "Густые сливки", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Масло", "grams": 120}, {"name": "Варенье", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Молотые миндаль", "grams": 50}, {"name": "Лимон", "grams": 100}, {"name": "Амаретто", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Миндаль", "grams": 50}]	https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/x6jqog1764359857.jpg	2026-05-03 20:14:45.821+00	2026-10-06 13:10:30.415+00	["дрожжи", "дрожж", "сахарная", "сахар", "сахарн", "пудра", "мука", "молоко", "молок", "яйца", "ванильный", "ванил", "ванильн", "экстракт", "экстр", "густые", "густы", "густ", "сливки", "сливк", "масло", "варенье", "варен", "молотые", "молот", "миндаль", "минда", "лимон", "амаретто", "амаре"]	step 1\r\nTo make the leaven, mix the yeast with the sugar and flour, and stir in the warm milk. Set aside in a warm place for 30 minutes.\r\n\r\nstep 2\r\nFor the dough, put egg yolks into a heatproof bowl and add the sugar and vanilla sugar. Set the bowl over a pan of simmering water and whisk until smooth and thick.\r\n\r\nstep 3\r\nSift the flour into the bowl of a stand mixer, add the beaten yolks and the warm cream, mix thoroughly, then add a pinch of salt and the leaven. Bring together to make a dough and knead for 10 minutes (or 15-20 if doing this by hand).\r\n\r\nstep 4\r\nWhen the dough stops sticking to your hands, pour in the cooled melted butter and knead for a few more minutes. Cover with a cloth and leave in a warm place to rise for at least 1 hr-1 hr 30 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nMix the jam with the ground almonds and spoon into a piping bag or jam syringe. Divide the dough into 16 pieces and shape them into doughnuts. Cover and leave to rise for 30 mins.\r\n\r\nstep 6\r\nFill a deep pan or a deep fat fryer one third full of oil or melted lard and heat it until it is 180C тАУ if you donтАЩt have a thermometer, drop in a small chunk of bread. The oil is ready when it browns in about 30 secs. Add the doughnuts and fry, turning them once for about 1-2 mins on each side (a thin lighter ring should form in the middle). After removing, drain the doughnuts of excess fat on some kitchen paper.	3	\N	Polish	["перекус"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/polish-doughnuts	mealdb:53298	[{"id": "93c86100-5b61-46cc-aa5f-ce9ad7dddd08", "name": "Дрожжи", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "8173f05b-53c4-4ba6-a714-740bc2534450", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "2dc74cbc-c6f3-4ee6-8ab6-b58ef1493936", "name": "Сахарная пудра", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "0ae3eca4-e36e-42f4-ae8e-a3f42bcb8501", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "be988adb-e1da-4907-b7b0-c29c6838e630", "name": "Мука", "unit": "г", "grams": 65, "amount": 65, "ingredientId": "6b9d37d6-50b6-41f6-bc22-2376d8109821", "originalString": "65 г"}, {"id": "5d221acb-bf2a-4ee9-ae65-9413b44d045e", "name": "Молоко", "unit": "мл", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "d106cc74-1977-4922-ba5e-2a79a179b0ab", "originalString": "50 мл"}, {"id": "6aa9dceb-de3f-4557-a5ad-dd865c049081", "name": "Яйца", "unit": "г", "grams": 350, "amount": 350, "ingredientId": "2fc401b0-e772-47dd-bd82-3638f892a36d", "originalString": "350 г"}, {"id": "023e58e2-93c3-4f39-ba3d-a956ae58a0a1", "name": "Сахар", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "f686d932-ccf2-4d50-9f23-2e0375fdd9d4", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "011e3c64-f4c5-4d01-a28e-9d83570ed67d", "name": "Ванильный экстракт", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "b614f73e-8060-4cfa-875b-64b6e12221ff", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "b6c998b0-7726-4438-b8f5-bbd9a3342e28", "name": "Густые сливки", "unit": "мл", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "bbff168c-afd7-