lt, cover and simmer for 30 minutes; remove the lid after 10 minutes, and cook until the sauce is thick and rich. Remove from the heat, stir through the olives and remaining fennel seeds and set aside until youтАЩre ready to serve.\r\n\r\nBring a large pot of salted water to a boil, add the pasta and cook for 12-14 minutes (or according to the instructions on the packet), until al dente. Meanwhile, reheat the sauce. Drain the pasta, return it to the pot, stir in a tablespoon of oil, then divide between the bowls. \r\n\r\nPut all the pesto ingredients except the basil in the small bowl of a food processor. Add a tablespoon of water and blitz to a rough paste. Add the basil, then blitz until just combined (the pesto has a much better texture if the basil is not overblended).\r\n\r\nSpoon over the rag├╣ and top with a spoonful of pesto. Finish with a sprinkling of chopped fennel fronds, if you have any, and serve at once.	4	\N	Italian	["ужин"]	t	http://www.ottolenghi.co.uk/recipes/meat/rigatoni-with-fennel-sausage-sauce-and-pecorino-and-anchovy-pesto-shop	mealdb:52783	[{"id": "0b631ed7-a00c-4256-b78b-f1a3fb260a78", "name": "Оливковое масло", "unit": "мл", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "bbc2d001-a24b-49ee-b8ec-16e74e7297ef", "originalString": "100 мл"}, {"id": "162fbe56-0078-4b5c-bec8-54d756123e97", "name": "Итальянская колбаса из фенхеля", "unit": "г", "grams": 300, "amount": 300, "ingredientId": "6d9fe7dc-ccb2-4dc5-9030-32c9fdbbd88b", "originalString": "300 г"}, {"id": "7f0448ac-c227-4441-b7ca-520fcc9315b8", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "ed87c71c-cb74-47e4-b453-71389a569cec", "name": "Луковица фенхеля", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "068d8f0b-19ae-4a82-b84d-5b14286027cb", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "32077963-0106-481b-a243-d2e3d1bfc56f", "name": "Копченая паприка", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "i