mer for about 2 more minutes. \r\n\r\nDiscard bay leave, thyme spring and serve over fish with a side of this bammy. You may make the sauce about 2 days in advance.	3	\N	Jamaican	["ужин"]	t	https://www.africanbites.com/jamaican-escovitched-fish/	mealdb:52944	[{"id": "003c07c2-b55c-4d93-aeed-051c29557eb1", "name": "Рыба красноперка", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "10e3a39b-b0b9-4ce4-b6fc-4b1010f8c1b2", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "a7a77bf2-f5e2-431b-8a48-f5599f2703f9", "name": "Растительное масло", "unit": "мл", "grams": 120, "amount": 120, "ingredientId": "f31757af-f603-41e1-ab30-25997e3cdada", "originalString": "120 мл"}, {"id": "1fd602cd-39d2-4bda-828d-167d0076dcbd", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "5b19ffa7-8386-4745-9826-00e55f04d04a", "name": "Имбирь", "unit": "г", "grams": 2.5, "amount": 2.5, "ingredientId": "245533a8-d5cb-4feb-9254-2f888a3b4f85", "originalString": "2.5 г"}, {"id": "b21e20bf-6853-487d-b223-61b67baa4dbf", "name": "Тимьян", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "3a6a2c31-dbd7-492c-9fe4-89ce8bcf3db8", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "3bb90eac-5f65-4c7b-8fe3-c9eadf68928d", "name": "Лавровый лист", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "74796ff2-897a-4931-9396-b51b81fda780", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "fbd10c58-ef09-4a97-87be-9766d6b1af20", "name": "Красный перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 25, "amount": 25, "ingredientId": "8f4685b1-4b0f-407f-a77e-e4b3205c8ca6", "originalString": "25 г"}, {"id": "70e84705-d986-4e9e-9e5d-e18a690527b1", "name": "Желтый перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 25, "amount": 25, "ingredientId": "9ef41b35-16d3-4752-8ab0-698c0d4da8ca", "originalString": "25 г"}, {"id": "c2da76bb-ddd5-4758-9592-aaf1bd96f938", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 