!) If you donтАЩt mix it enough it will not set well enough, but donтАЩt get impatient and whisk it really quick because thatтАЩll make it split! Spread over the biscuit base and leave to set in the fridge overnight.\r\n\r\n4) Remove the Cheesecake from the tin carefully and decorate the cheesecake тАУ I drizzled over some of the spare caramel, and then some Toffee Popcorn and more Pretzels!	2	\N	United States	["перекус"]	t	http://www.janespatisserie.com/2015/11/09/no-bake-salted-caramel-cheesecake/	mealdb:52833	[{"id": "67bd26d3-5582-4637-8f75-997bf5e04660", "name": "Песочное печенье", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "e250f389-decf-475e-8199-db93b221613f", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "56509c0b-f915-4ca5-9f87-c7174a7dbd43", "name": "Крекеры", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "13e9bf69-884c-402d-a5ed-32ef1e6daa7a", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "49341278-3a54-4568-a5d3-7b0b9403bb9e", "name": "Масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "cce3a06f-ceba-4080-8aa4-4457cf9d48e5", "name": "Сливочный сыр", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "22dc850e-3571-4cb4-9322-90e70cedaa00", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "5fa1a740-929d-4866-9d75-cc9cf49d5bc3", "name": "Ванильный экстракт", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "b614f73e-8060-4cfa-875b-64b6e12221ff", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "e68ad65a-aede-4827-ba9e-ab6faf79f52c", "name": "Сахарная пудра", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "0ae3eca4-e36e-42f4-ae8e-a3f42bcb8501", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "b6e5a3bb-c4f8-4139-a11c-c8c57c9a0019", "name": "Карамель", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "aa0d52b8-ede6-43ed-bc69-6a080fa5d0ef", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "bd2aebe1-0c3d-4d96-9569-34eb0e0397e3", "name": "Морская соль", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId":