 times, then bake for 15 mins. If a lot of juice bubbles up the side of the pan, pour it off at this stage (see guide). Reduce oven to 180C/fan 160C/gas 4 and bake for 15 mins more until the pastry is golden. Leave the tart to stand for 10 mins, then invert it carefully onto a serving dish.	2	\N	France	["перекус"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/4778/pear-tarte-tatin	mealdb:52916	[{"id": "f56f7e94-3964-476e-8b8a-4a45ff84fe29", "name": "Груши", "unit": "г", "grams": 400, "amount": 400, "ingredientId": "58926a00-9ea9-4d09-ad20-0e481c901309", "originalString": "400 г"}, {"id": "feb994ab-1d90-4b50-82b7-e0d140e4744a", "name": "Сахарная пудра", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "0ae3eca4-e36e-42f4-ae8e-a3f42bcb8501", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "0316abb9-83b1-45d3-8c7f-ee6025e822ab", "name": "Масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "f4380b98-9e68-4ccb-8967-1ea9742f7d64", "name": "Звезда анис", "unit": "шт", "grams": 60, "amount": 1, "ingredientId": "6f9619f1-97bf-4361-9bf9-72a88d9d1f92", "originalString": "1 шт"}, {"id": "4625da82-56bc-4c19-b8c7-b684a94d4f2c", "name": "Кардамон", "unit": "шт", "grams": 60, "amount": 1, "ingredientId": "5dd52155-0745-4004-84dd-6ef596f58f82", "originalString": "1 шт"}, {"id": "49503a2c-ec54-41ba-b519-a52bf7475a06", "name": "Корица", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "c508be3b-b158-45c7-9a46-2326abea13d0", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "ae9f9551-9f18-4a34-8d08-d0217972061b", "name": "Бренди", "unit": "мл", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "5de60497-b26a-4b8a-90f9-cd0017975ab1", "originalString": "100 мл"}, {"id": "b03152a9-69f6-4761-8123-183a02d5643d", "name": "Слоёное тесто", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4ccd5ab0-8da3-414a-9cb0-b6cc27e05f73", "originalString": "50 г"}]	[]	t	\N
