, dill pickles (if using), the chives and a zig-zag drizzle of ketchup.	3	\N	Polish	["ужин"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/zapiekanki	mealdb:53294	[{"id": "ad712b4f-7bb0-4d1d-aad6-6d7d585ef4a3", "name": "Багет", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "85318cf3-86e2-4b2a-80fb-e2e720c24134", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "c45527bc-3d47-48fa-9b10-c60cc4bb9860", "name": "Масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 15, "amount": 15, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "15 г"}, {"id": "125092a7-1b25-4d2c-893e-7e81d38d22ba", "name": "Растительное масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "f31757af-f603-41e1-ab30-25997e3cdada", "originalString": "10 г"}, {"id": "043d5ace-184e-4f1b-86ca-48c53dc4abe1", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "e1b5f411-9e34-4be4-bb5c-5ff2b7362554", "name": "Грибы", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "97f04ffa-f6a9-4e22-b285-58e2a13b33b0", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "bf80854e-2b3f-40da-b076-dc5e06941c45", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "3ed3ecf8-9f51-4e5c-b721-3ad28d39c0d5", "name": "Майонез", "unit": "г", "grams": 15, "amount": 15, "ingredientId": "f346eb0c-92b1-46f4-b9d1-d9ca8719f1ed", "originalString": "15 г"}, {"id": "a048c087-ace4-4a7b-87e2-5a729f0f8540", "name": "Сыр чеддер", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "7f31967f-ec5b-4122-9a9b-851a55a553f7", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "a7767315-43a2-4a02-a8fb-10d1768b1dd0", "name": "Ветчина", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "d1897340-0c4b-46c6-9cf8-5e4586cc0597", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "2108dd0a-0158-4613-ac13-47f66d36b8a8", "name": "Польский kabanos", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "cf011