, for 30-35 minutes.\r\nWhen there is about 15 minutes remaining, stir in potato and continue to cook covered.\r\nOnce chicken is cooked and potatoes are softened, remove from heat. Salt and pepper to taste.	3	\N	Jamaican	["ужин"]	t	https://www.myforkinglife.com/jamaican-curry-chicken/	mealdb:53345	[{"id": "2ebfe8f2-126d-4259-b149-6cdc8ebfa393", "name": "Куриные бёдра", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "4408ccda-a27e-4db6-bc16-bef8099e89a5", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "218e6b13-52fd-4a95-aad4-ba23de60896d", "name": "Карри-порошок", "unit": "г", "grams": 125, "amount": 125, "ingredientId": "c6ae8094-4a13-4352-8682-807858aeeb95", "originalString": "125 г"}, {"id": "87ce5c53-6b6c-4c66-9cf7-61bd8e8af7ee", "name": "Приправа универсальная", "unit": "г", "grams": 5, "amount": 5, "ingredientId": "2a248dac-f550-4f8a-a1bc-8b0487689e38", "originalString": "5 г"}, {"id": "706fd78f-fbb7-4c0b-a778-490fc3f63776", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "d363b4ab-2ae6-4482-8756-8b7fa18830a1", "name": "Зелёный лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "e15bcbde-b1b4-4df4-a673-98865ea67f17", "originalString": "150 г"}, {"id": "fb813da8-a270-41ef-9253-c83476e16708", "name": "Зелёный перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 25, "amount": 25, "ingredientId": "072acccf-9156-4814-84e9-26b94c6928c0", "originalString": "25 г"}, {"id": "3d78ae11-516c-4305-9e4b-15194d87df0e", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "28c8625d-20fa-46b9-9d99-7b3dc470e844", "name": "Перец шотландец", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "62420a80-294d-4cb9-a759-90a426c693d1", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "eb37e24d-dd45-48dd-8318-8f1a312fc726", "name": "Тимьян", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "3a6a2c31-dbd7-