ht dip in the centre. Bake for 30 mins, then lower temperature to 150C/fan 130C/gas 2 and bake a further 2-2┬╝ hrs, until a skewer insterted in the middle comes out clean. Leave to cool in the tin, then take out of the tin and peel off the lining paper. When completely cold, wrap well in cling film and foil to store until ready to decorate. The cake will keep for several months.	3	\N	British	["перекус"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/angela-nilsens-christmas-cake	mealdb:52990	[{"id": "8af700d6-6b8c-463d-8485-8a1e70670aac", "name": "Масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "8e8b507e-fc56-4aa6-a987-b9fa5143150f", "name": "Сахар мусковадо", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "a0c7e794-985b-4adc-b7f8-f8eb27b753eb", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "2b935d1f-107f-438a-bc17-06c0fdb613bc", "name": "Пшеничная мука", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "89fd83a9-9424-4975-a81b-218d640c70a2", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "8d1f5235-13f4-4204-b968-e7caf0120c9c", "name": "Яйца", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "2fc401b0-e772-47dd-bd82-3638f892a36d", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "1eacba9b-2857-41fc-aeaf-4558db02c0bd", "name": "Молотые миндаль", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4bb4a2d7-98b0-4236-b7c7-3b3f64286c92", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "b87a8b6a-20a9-4fc9-a153-3bcbb38ff9a2", "name": "Херес", "unit": "мл", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "977817c8-0233-4367-9e2d-f63617c7c642", "originalString": "50 мл"}, {"id": "d2ec7039-92e6-4cdd-9879-04f0e2014736", "name": "Цукатная корка", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "fc542d42-f589-409d-bf18-7e4f265acefb", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "353064e0-51ac-4955-835c-74132f1af913", "name": "Глазурированная вишня", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "089c2562-1cfb-429a-a878