 sugar over the top of each ramekin and caramelise using a kitchen blowtorch. Alternatively, slide the ramekins under a hot grill until the sugar turns golden and starts to bubble. Serve straightaway.	4	\N	Spanish	["перекус"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/crema-catalana	mealdb:53148	[{"id": "02abbc0c-1f46-4962-ad59-85bb303e9842", "name": "Молоко", "unit": "мл", "grams": 500, "amount": 500, "ingredientId": "d106cc74-1977-4922-ba5e-2a79a179b0ab", "originalString": "500 мл"}, {"id": "555a6773-f840-4e8f-913a-1b088c156687", "name": "Густые сливки", "unit": "мл", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "bbff168c-afd7-44e8-98cf-111d7e0af483", "originalString": "50 мл"}, {"id": "597196c1-2e80-474b-b74e-ac308749198c", "name": "Корица", "unit": "шт", "grams": 60, "amount": 1, "ingredientId": "c508be3b-b158-45c7-9a46-2326abea13d0", "originalString": "1 шт"}, {"id": "51d44fbc-1129-41b6-a9fa-6add98a11671", "name": "Цедра апельсина", "unit": "г", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "c95e58d7-28bf-4c00-90a2-be5394c244e8", "originalString": "10 г"}, {"id": "e8c12b7e-753e-4626-9b45-5eb81ce20e17", "name": "Цедра лимона", "unit": "г", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "0757638c-8d0f-45ab-8a86-5bd3d136f89b", "originalString": "10 г"}, {"id": "a97866a6-5111-4ad5-ad6f-e00784482edf", "name": "Яичные желтки", "unit": "шт", "grams": 360, "amount": 6, "ingredientId": "c5c468c1-d5d7-425e-9275-de6ea68f6e67", "originalString": "6 шт"}, {"id": "41cba067-01ef-452d-905a-8527676e64a4", "name": "Сахарная пудра", "unit": "г", "grams": 140, "amount": 140, "ingredientId": "0ae3eca4-e36e-42f4-ae8e-a3f42bcb8501", "originalString": "140 г"}, {"id": "c00e981e-951d-407a-935e-ccd4193fd2ed", "name": "Кукурузный крахмал", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "41137d44-eccd-4d8e-b985-ca171a3b3a50", "originalString": "50 г"}]	["vegetarian", "gluten-free"]	t	\N
