 stir until the carrots are soft, about 10 minutes. Do not let the vegetables brown.\r\n\r\nDeglaze the pan by pouring in the red wine and stirring to loosen all of the bits of food and flour that are stuck to the bottom. Season with the bay leaf, basil, marjoram, paprika, salt, pepper, caraway seeds and cayenne pepper; cook for 1 minute.\r\n\r\nMix in the dried mushrooms, hot pepper sauce, Worcestershire sauce, beef stock, tomato paste and tomatoes. Heat through just until boiling. Pour the vegetables and all of the liquid into the casserole dish with the meat. Cover with a lid.\r\n\r\nBake in the preheated oven for 2 1/2 to 3 hours, until meat is very tender.	8	\N	Polish	["ужин"]	t	https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/138131/bigos-hunters-stew/	mealdb:53018	[{"id": "2bea9507-b2a1-46cb-ad3b-955659e588ba", "name": "Бекон", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "ef1d7f34-d582-48bc-823e-88538f2e6ff8", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "cc12b61c-27b8-4e9a-afbb-355ac954fc21", "name": "Килбаса", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "d0d2cc07-68d2-4888-b275-dd55aaed291d", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "f2f43e7a-2b3c-46f4-9da6-b0e5bbf9fc79", "name": "Свинина", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4aeae1ae-8a32-41ea-af48-7828e4bd26a6", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "64de3368-a23a-47bf-a8c1-8c42684f88c8", "name": "Мука", "unit": "г", "grams": 60, "amount": 60, "ingredientId": "6b9d37d6-50b6-41f6-bc22-2376d8109821", "originalString": "60 г"}, {"id": "6b882fd9-4380-4efe-9dd2-2aeeca112bbf", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "150 г"}, {"id": "ba425aa1-1592-4b2e-a71c-0377427d8bca", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "93d2d4b3-b6a1-48af-8012-dc9d593ba6e5", "name": "Грибы", "unit": "г", "grams": 360, "amount": 3