 bread and add to the pan, turning it in the oil until lightly browned. Pulse in food processor with the tomatoes, salt, vinegar and oil until roughly chopped. Tip into a bowl. Leave to cool and store in fridge for up to 3 days.\r\n\r\nstep 5\r\nOn the day add the nuts and parsley to the sauce and mix. Serve in a small bowl on a plate with the peeled prawns. Supply cocktail sticks for spearing the prawns.	2	\N	Spanish	["ужин"]	t	https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/prawns-romesco-sauce	mealdb:53174	[{"id": "75101230-39c9-48de-8a89-1af9260b9a79", "name": "Красный перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "8f4685b1-4b0f-407f-a77e-e4b3205c8ca6", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "c2a312e1-ef32-474c-8178-6de94fa76aa3", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "150 г"}, {"id": "7869a811-643c-4497-ab0f-1addab756b40", "name": "Красный чили", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1bdf28f1-5237-485b-956d-fc1a25d21656", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "301a7b07-5b8c-4b03-8e14-932708a3013a", "name": "Помидор", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "56af0c35-84c3-4e11-8c83-f306df2b10eb", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "bcecc90d-8321-4a28-8446-7959be71d4f1", "name": "Орехи фундук", "unit": "г", "grams": 500, "amount": 500, "ingredientId": "5c7fb015-9071-4048-8315-2fcf0eb1bb3c", "originalString": "500 г"}, {"id": "22ee782a-d773-4edf-b2e6-fb16145b23ce", "name": "Миндаль", "unit": "г", "grams": 500, "amount": 500, "ingredientId": "e2d86884-2548-43b1-90cc-fc741c8f32ca", "originalString": "500 г"}, {"id": "c2adb8b2-52b5-4791-a586-15da474dbc1b", "name": "Петрушка", "unit": "г", "grams": 150, "amount": 150, "ingredientId": "6f6bca24-b7e6-4c6a-9f84-86fb3e2c9dcd", "originalString": "150 г"}, {"id": "ee66a914-ca52-468b-b121-dc4c3ef1150d", "name": "Хлеб", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "c91eb3ce-ad08-438e-b020-4