with the beaten egg yolks and lay the pastry over the top. Brush the top of the pastry with more beaten egg.\r\nTrim the pastry so there is just enough excess to crimp the edges, then place in the oven and bake for 30 minutes, or until the pastry is golden-brown and cooked through.\r\nFor the green beans, bring a saucepan of salted water to the boil, add the beans and cook for 4-5 minutes, or until just tender.\r\nDrain and toss with the butter, then season with black pepper.\r\nTo serve, place a large spoonful of pie onto each plate with some green beans alongside.	3	\N	British	["ужин"]	t	https://www.bbc.co.uk/food/recipes/beef_and_mustard_pie_58002	mealdb:52874	[{"id": "e6be5f60-14fb-4578-9eda-68ba2c5537f9", "name": "Говядина", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "6faa9697-3013-4635-a452-09e75c62051a", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "07805471-4f5c-48d8-ba71-f234b4ef8659", "name": "Пшеничная мука", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "89fd83a9-9424-4975-a81b-218d640c70a2", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "1848f499-e972-4434-80ed-2cf20273156f", "name": "Масло рапса", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "70e5c0be-d63c-4845-bc2a-20f57287c083", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "e2b5224e-4d13-4a3c-8620-6159ad2d20ac", "name": "Красное вино", "unit": "мл", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "e9a14389-b83b-487a-8d46-ff197ced56a8", "originalString": "50 мл"}, {"id": "c7fa0b99-54d2-4977-88a5-6cee4e90f129", "name": "Говяжий бульон", "unit": "мл", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "e4abe98d-da0e-4159-8aed-2ce633951fc1", "originalString": "50 мл"}, {"id": "78bb22b1-9c82-4d49-8df0-23a156f24793", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "ac50591a-6967-4dea-bb55-21f81f4a83a9", "name": "Морковь", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "3ab14c63-202a-4334-b30c-9674ce7ef8fd",