a926643f-17b4-4f4e-b308-8301bd2cfb3b	Алжирские ферикдельки	lunch	461	43.8	24.4	13.1	{морепродукты}	[{"name": "Говяжий фарш", "grams": 480}, {"name": "Чеснок", "grams": 200}, {"name": "Лук", "grams": 150}, {"name": "Соль", "grams": 5}, {"name": "Перец", "grams": 3}, {"name": "Помидоры", "grams": 120}, {"name": "Петрушка", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Вода", "grams": 120}]	https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/8rfd4q1764112993.jpg	2026-05-03 20:13:54.141+00	2026-10-06 13:02:27.361+00	["говяжий", "говяж", "фарш", "чеснок", "чесно", "лук", "соль", "перец", "помидоры", "помид", "петрушка", "петру", "вода"]	Combine ground beef with 1/2 of the minced garlic and 1 tablespoon chopped onion in a large bowl. Mix with your hands until fully incorporated. Shape meat mixture into 1 1/2-inch oblong patties; you should have 12 to 14 meatballs.\r\n\r\nHeat a large skillet over medium-high heat. Brown patties in batches in the hot skillet until crispy on both sides and no longer pink in the center, about 10 minutes. Set meatballs aside in a rimmed serving dish.\r\n\r\nReduce heat to medium and stir remaining chopped onion into drippings in the skillet. Season with salt and pepper. Cook, stirring constantly, until onion has softened and turned translucent, about 5 minutes. Stir in remaining garlic and cook for 30 seconds. Stir in Roma tomatoes, dried parsley, and ras el hanout. Pour in water. Cook until tomatoes are soft, about 5 minutes.\r\n\r\nPour tomato sauce over meatballs to serve.	3	\N	Algerian	["ужин"]	t	https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/153790/algerian-kefta-meatballs/	mealdb:53281	[{"id": "5c4ab230-1e41-4f80-b220-6748b5067714", "name": "Говяжий фарш", "unit": "г", "grams": 500, "amount": 500, "ingredientId": "15229283-665a-43f5-8bb0-69faf5749d2f", "originalString": "500 г"}, {"id": "5671503d-ff51-46d9-a50e-5d1c4ae7e543", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "ce