tir until incpororated.\r\nPour mixture into prepared loaf pan and bake in the preheated oven for 50-60 minutes or until a toothpick comes out clean.\r\nCool for 5 minutes in the pan and then move to a cooling rack to finish cooling. Serve with slices of cheddar cheese.	8	\N	Jamaican	["перекус"]	t	https://www.myforkinglife.com/easter-spice-bread-jamaican-style/#recipe	mealdb:53348	[{"id": "d45f37c9-3a1e-40c6-9454-83c5f0ff0218", "name": "Мука высшего сорта", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "b3379777-9901-468d-bca7-43790200c5d5", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "e6631ca0-5271-493b-af22-643bcae47ff2", "name": "Разрыхлитель", "unit": "г", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "972b3e3a-16f2-4ec2-b5e3-2bd543cca16d", "originalString": "10 г"}, {"id": "12ce0008-2abf-4081-a394-8560b971a55b", "name": "Молотая корица", "unit": "г", "grams": 10, "amount": 10, "ingredientId": "bd59c7c9-4302-46cc-9554-f9762887d074", "originalString": "10 г"}, {"id": "0c1a1477-d07d-4f99-9689-8d378ac85144", "name": "Соль", "unit": "г", "grams": 2.5, "amount": 2.5, "ingredientId": "3789cffa-31e4-49d0-bca4-aded4002f42c", "originalString": "2.5 г"}, {"id": "9f7079ae-ecb7-4084-aee6-9b03d6731ac2", "name": "Яйцо", "unit": "шт", "grams": 2750, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "cab42edd-5e3a-4893-839e-9f4ef50c6cf0", "originalString": "50 шт"}, {"id": "741448a3-dd61-493a-9d97-1c5aca0a44b4", "name": "Коричневый сахар", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1d6fcd50-9e69-4015-9bea-1a9ae790690e", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "3f87eb7c-f651-45f3-8ace-7be1e2882f57", "name": "Пиво", "unit": "мл", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "2a0ebe67-98cb-4a12-ac04-b06f1876e0b0", "originalString": "50 мл"}, {"id": "4329628e-8435-4041-b644-d87a7a32eef9", "name": "Молоко", "unit": "мл", "grams": 80, "amount": 80, "ingredientId": "d106cc74-1977-4922-ba5e-2a79a179b0ab", "originalString": "80 мл"}, {"id": "924f0858-9167-4a5f-bd42-49e8ccc631d7", "name": "Мёд", "unit": 