t├й until fragrant. Optionally, add prawns.\r\n\r\nAdd in 1/4 amount of tofu, boiled potatoes, cabbage, Chinese flowering cabbage and prawn fritters. Saut├й for another 30 seconds.\r\n\r\nAdd noodles to the wok. Add 3 tablespoons of dark soy sauce mixture. Mix evenly for the next 1 minute. Then, move the noodles to the side of the wok. Stir in an egg. Garnish with a slice of lime and slices of green chilies. To cook another plate of noodles, repeat from step 5 onwards.	8	\N	Malaysian	["ужин"]	t	https://www.nyonyacooking.com/recipes/mee-goreng-mamak~BkTLRjTuX	mealdb:53048	[{"id": "2b7ec7b3-3a9b-4c2f-8d0a-0e34d9784625", "name": "Арахис", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "32b4cfd3-2973-4a5e-acd4-7fbe0fd71a7a", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "5c9700ec-06de-4d43-91a5-087355b425d4", "name": "Перец чили", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "b976dce4-53c5-496d-bb37-a394d0de4e02", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "e143079f-3ea3-4236-8d77-32db9b75e781", "name": "Креветки", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "217c513d-310e-4472-adf1-8dc55e9df4bf", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "eddb20e5-2def-4560-87eb-d5dd820a898e", "name": "Масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 250, "amount": 250, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalString": "250 г"}, {"id": "10ba729a-f911-45e5-a4ab-f2abe028d407", "name": "Вода", "unit": "мл", "grams": 750, "amount": 750, "ingredientId": "1eec42eb-3a97-4791-8cb2-da60cef6bc13", "originalString": "750 мл"}, {"id": "1103a37b-2623-4478-8ab0-276aae868f6a", "name": "Паста из тамаринда", "unit": "г", "grams": 25, "amount": 25, "ingredientId": "9c455efa-f502-4197-99ce-6ed0fefd11eb", "originalString": "25 г"}, {"id": "ba7b396f-4a6a-4c38-a1c8-fd31abc00294", "name": "Картофель", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "99928917-5708-4040-aefa-1a6d06d27937", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "7254b767-7889-4f4a-a3dd-745812a26bf6", "name": "Красный лук", "unit": "