t vegetables are tender. NOTE: Do not cook too much, or they will fall apart.\r\nTaste and add salt to your taste, if necessary. Add cilantro and the remaining 2 minced garlic cloves. Mix and let simmer for 2 more minutes.\r\nServe hot in large soup bowls, dividing the meat and vegetables evenly. Add a squish of lime juice and/or hot sauce, if desired. Serve along with arepas and or casabe (cassava bread).	8	\N	Venezuela	["ужин"]	t	https://mommyshomecooking.com/easy-venezuelan-sancocho/#recipe	mealdb:53326	[{"id": "d2012a80-d6bb-4681-a086-7108526350a3", "name": "Баранина (голяшка)", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "e6886a56-1765-4be8-b92f-fa433d73636f", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "a50e218b-6524-45d3-bb7e-a08f222612dc", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "9fcf3459-a1c2-4779-8334-7aac453dbbe3", "name": "Перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 25, "amount": 25, "ingredientId": "01a35a87-6c12-4f1b-87cf-323571bc15cd", "originalString": "25 г"}, {"id": "f45230b0-6aca-4579-a8cf-efbb0d176707", "name": "Чеснок", "unit": "г", "grams": 200, "amount": 200, "ingredientId": "91e7717c-e7a3-40d1-ad26-cbf9f854ab62", "originalString": "200 г"}, {"id": "e81ad95e-fdbc-476e-b3cd-8003f640a82e", "name": "Лук-порей", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "7c3f95ba-19e8-40ba-bae6-641396ab35a4", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "d0a577f5-7367-43d6-a96c-b3e8f4dc38aa", "name": "Говяжий бульон", "unit": "мл", "grams": 1920, "amount": 1920, "ingredientId": "e4abe98d-da0e-4159-8aed-2ce633951fc1", "originalString": "1920 мл"}, {"id": "e4212d0b-fe51-4e0f-8a13-2dc6c0b05280", "name": "Сладкий красный перец", "unit": "г", "grams": 120, "amount": 120, "ingredientId": "36b94c12-a334-4df3-9dd3-29b728a2f04c", "originalString": "120 г"}, {"id": "e17d8140-f348-481d-87d4-d56ac7b965f5", "name": "Зеленый лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 120, "amount": 120, "ingr