ad6ff0aa-52b9-4324-9bc3-86eecf3fb9d9	Курица с запечённой морковью и картофельным пюре	lunch	468	33.4	24.3	26.8	{лактоза}	[{"name": "Куриная грудка", "grams": 200}, {"name": "Морковь", "grams": 640}, {"name": "Картофель", "grams": 300}, {"name": "Лук", "grams": 75}, {"name": "Говяжий бульон", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Моцарелла", "grams": 360}, {"name": "Сметана", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Масло", "grams": 60}, {"name": "Соль", "grams": 5}, {"name": "Перец", "grams": 3}]	https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/b5ft861583188991.jpg	2026-05-03 20:14:18.844+00	2026-10-06 15:06:14.984+00	["куриная", "курин", "грудка", "грудк", "морковь", "морко", "картофель", "карто", "лук", "говяжий", "говяж", "бульон", "бульо", "моцарелла", "моцар", "сметана", "смета", "масло", "соль", "перец"]	1\r\n\r\nPreheat oven to 425 degrees. Wash and dry all produce. Trim, peel, and cut carrots on a diagonal into ┬╝-inch-thick pieces. Dice potatoes into ┬╜-inch pieces. Halve, peel, and thinly slice onion.\r\n\r\n2\r\n\r\nToss carrots on a baking sheet with a drizzle of oil, salt, and pepper. Roast until browned and tender, 15-20 minutes.\r\n\r\n3\r\n\r\nMeanwhile, place potatoes in a medium pot with enough salted water to cover by 2 inches. Bring to a boil and cook until tender, 12-15 minutes. Drain and return potatoes to pot; cover to keep warm.\r\n\r\n4\r\n\r\nWhile potatoes cook, heat a drizzle of oil in a large pan over medium-high heat. Add onion and cook, stirring occasionally, until lightly browned and softened, 8-10 minutes. Sprinkle with 1 tsp sugar (2 tsp for 4 servings). Stir in stock concentrate and 2 TBSP water (┬╝ cup for 4); season with salt and pepper. Cook until jammy, 2-3 minutes more. Turn off heat; transfer to a small bowl. Wash out pan.\r\n\r\n5\r\n\r\nPat chicken dry with paper towels; season all over with salt and pepper. Heat a drizzle of oil in pan used for onion over medium-high heat. Add chicken and cook until browned and cooked through, 5-6 minutes per side. In the last 1-2 minutes of cooking, top with caramelized onion and cheese. Cover pan until cheese melts. (If your pan doesnтАЩt have a lid, cover with a baking sheet!)\r\n\r\n6\r\n\r\nHeat pot with drained potatoes over low heat; mash with sour cream, 2 TBSP butter (4 TBSP for 4 servings), salt, pepper, and a splash of water (or milk, for extra richness) until smooth. Divide chicken, roasted carrots, and mashed potatoes between plates.	5	\N	United States	["ужин"]	t	\N	mealdb:52996	[{"id": "f3c0e85e-fece-461e-9084-f422c6ce0eb3", "name": "Куриная грудка", "unit": "г", "grams": 100, "amount": 100, "ingredientId": "12c12878-ea46-4858-9358-8795cf84fcbb", "originalString": "100 г"}, {"id": "9b041cda-1e57-439b-9392-1091a2a2c9e8", "name": "Морковь", "unit": "г", "grams": 600, "amount": 600, "ingredientId": "3ab14c63-202a-4334-b30c-9674ce7ef8fd", "originalString": "600 г"}, {"id": "0f3b8ec6-dfb4-42a1-9a91-e35af3b136f9", "name": "Картофель", "unit": "г", "grams": 250, "amount": 250, "ingredientId": "99928917-5708-4040-aefa-1a6d06d27937", "originalString": "250 г"}, {"id": "915e773f-e3a0-4802-9210-e411f9200e4a", "name": "Лук", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "4c6015ce-c6bb-4495-8a13-ea54fd4567dd", "originalString": "50 г"}, {"id": "80b580a4-1cec-4532-b685-17b5cf069f2f", "name": "Говяжий бульон", "unit": "мл", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "e4abe98d-da0e-4159-8aed-2ce633951fc1", "originalString": "50 мл"}, {"id": "cea4c9c2-8322-4bb4-9f77-d5a31539a1fc", "name": "Моцарелла", "unit": "г", "grams": 360, "amount": 360, "ingredientId": "0dffaf8d-3d14-4ff8-937e-08d9a2b34990", "originalString": "360 г"}, {"id": "6aa0388d-57c7-4c7f-9569-66b63d7cdea5", "name": "Сметана", "unit": "г", "grams": 30, "amount": 30, "ingredientId": "4444a8fe-2206-4e3b-bba5-e239526acdda", "originalString": "30 г"}, {"id": "0c542625-b74e-470f-8a30-8a94f079c8fa", "name": "Масло", "unit": "г", "grams": 50, "amount": 50, "ingredientId": "1338b99b-c8f0-44df-af06-d78808709d42", "originalS